msgid "Sardine Addy"
msgstr "沙丁鱼艾迪"

msgid "\"Never underestimate the power of a determined school of sardines!\""
msgstr "\"永远不要低估一群坚定的沙丁鱼的力量！\""

msgid "Sardine Sisters, attack!"
msgstr "沙丁鱼姐妹，进攻！"

msgid "Sardine Milli"
msgstr "沙丁鱼小米"

msgid "\"The Sardine Sisters bow down to no one!\""
msgstr "\"沙丁鱼姐妹不向任何人低头！\""

msgid "Sardine Alva"
msgstr "沙丁鱼阿尔瓦"

msgid "\"Enough sardines together can take down any big fish!\""
msgstr "\"足够多的沙丁鱼加在一起就能吃掉任何一条大鱼！\""

msgid "Feel our sardine wrath!"
msgstr "感受我们沙丁鱼的愤怒吧！"

msgid "Flying Dutchman"
msgstr "飞翔的荷兰人"

#. TODO add higher quality map
msgid "The Beast"
msgstr "野兽"

msgid "You hear a weird sort of growling over the communication channel."
msgstr "你会听到通讯频道里传来奇怪的咆哮声。"

msgid "Grrrrrrrawwwwwrrrr!"
msgstr "呵呵！"

msgid ""
"You hear more weird growling sounds over the communication channel. It "
"doesn't look like they are interested in discussion."
msgstr "你在通讯频道上听到更多奇怪的咆哮声。看起来他们对讨论不感兴趣。"

msgid "Three-Eyed Tanith"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I'm keeping an eye on you. Scratch that, I'm keeping all three on you!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "I was itchin' for some action!"
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Ya just gonna call it quits?\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Left Eye"
msgstr ""

msgid "Right Eye"
msgstr ""

msgid "Raven's Talon"
msgstr "渡鸦的魔爪"

msgid ""
"\"When I get sick of hauling cargo for the Raven Clan, nothing helps me "
"unwind like some good old fashion piracy.\""
msgstr "当我厌倦了为渡鸦氏族拉货时，没有什么比一些老式的盗版更能帮我解脱了。"

msgid "Fighters, engage!"
msgstr "战士们，开始战斗！"

msgid "Barrel 'o Joy"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"\"I packed this Zebra with all the explosives I could fit. Gonna have "
"fireworks lighting up 'em skies!\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Let me show you what this barrel is made of!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Shroomancer"
msgstr "房客"

msgid ""
"\"Did you know that there are over 5,000 types of psychedelic mushrooms "
"grown on Sanchez alone?\""
msgstr "\"你知道吗，仅桑切斯就种植了5000多种迷幻蘑菇？\""

msgid "You're ruining my vibes, soul!"
msgstr "你在破坏我的共鸣，灵魂！"

msgid "Feldspar"
msgstr "长石"

msgid ""
"\"I've been working overtime to get my rank up in the Black Lotus. I won't "
"be the underdog forever!\""
msgstr "我一直在加班加点，争取在黑莲的排名上升。我不会永远做失败者的！"

msgid "You're my ticket to a promotion. Die!"
msgstr "你是我升职的入场券。去死吧！"

msgid "Lapis Lazuli"
msgstr "青金石"

msgid ""
"\"With so many careless merchants flying around, business has never been "
"better. I always like to get my hands dirty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"这么多粗心商人在太空乱窜，买卖从没这么红火过。我就好这口亲自下场的痛快劲"
"儿。\""

msgid "Let me add you to my trophy collection!"
msgstr "让我把你加入我的奖杯收藏吧！"

msgid ""
"\"It's hard being a rising star in the Black Lotus. They expect so much from "
"you. Good thing I'm an overachiever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"在黑莲当后起之秀很难。他们对你的期望太高了。幸好我是个超常的成功者。\""

msgid "It's my time to shine!"
msgstr "这是我发光的时候了！"

msgid "Emerald"
msgstr "翡翠"

msgid ""
"\"Paperwork is such a bore. I escaped from the Empire to join the Black "
"Lotus only to find I have to fill out more and more paperwork as I rise in "
"rank. Maybe I should have joined the Wild Ones instead?\""
msgstr ""
"\"文书工作太无聊了。我从帝国逃亡到黑莲花，却发现随着职位的提升，我必须填写越"
"来越多的文书工作。也许我应该加入狂野一族组织？\""

msgid "Time for some fun!"
msgstr "是时候来点乐子了！"

msgid "Topaz"
msgstr "黄玉"

msgid "(ΦωΦ)"
msgstr "(ΦωΦ)"

msgid "\"(｢・ω・)｢\""
msgstr "\"(\"·ω·)\"\""

msgid ""
"\"It's nice being near the top of the pecking order. It's fun to give "
"contradictory orders to your subordinates and see them run around in chaos.\""
msgstr ""
"\"接近权力金字塔顶端的感觉不错。给下属下达自相矛盾的指令，看着他们乱作一团瞎"
"忙活，其乐无穷啊。\""

msgid "Time to snare another bonus!"
msgstr "是时候再收获奖金了！"

#. Need at least some presence
#. Medium ships here
msgid "Serra Scion"
msgstr "塞拉·西翁"

msgid ""
"\"The Serra Echelon is the pride of House Sirius. As a Scion, I bear the "
"weight of responsibility truthfully.\""
msgstr ""
"\"塞拉梯队是天狼星家族的骄傲。作为一个后裔，我诚实地承担着责任的重担。\""

msgid "You dare test my faith?! The Serra Scion shall not waiver!"
msgstr "你敢考验我的信仰？！塞拉子孙不得放弃！"

msgid "\"You think you can buy my faith with mere credits?\""
msgstr "\"你以为仅仅靠信用点就能买到我的信仰吗？\""

msgid "Zealot Sri Chatri"
msgstr "狂热分子斯里·查特里"

msgid "Stay vigilant, for we are always tested against wickedness."
msgstr "保持警惕，因为我们总是受到邪恶的考验。"

msgid "We must be beacons of faith in the eternal darkness."
msgstr "我们必须成为永恒黑暗中信仰的灯塔。"

msgid ""
"\"There will never be rest as long as the wicked remain unpunished. I will "
"strive as long as faith drives me.\""
msgstr "\"只要恶人不受惩罚，就永远不会有安息。只要信仰驱使我，我就会奋斗。\""

msgid "Prepare for retribution!"
msgstr "准备好接受惩罚吧！"

msgid "\"I am not swayed by your petty coins.\""
msgstr "\"我不会被你的小钱所动摇。\""

msgid "Squire"
msgstr "乡绅"

msgid "Zealot Sri Kaeya"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Sirichana is all that keeps us from succumbing to evil! All Praise the "
"Sirichana!"
msgstr ""

msgid "The hordes of darkness are coming! Your faith must not sway!"
msgstr ""

msgid "\"The light of the Sirichana will protect us all.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Time for cleansing!"
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Grimy credits will not sway me.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Fidel"
msgstr ""

msgid "Star Voyager"
msgstr ""

msgid "\"The skies of Mutris are ever so beautiful.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Such senseless violence!"
msgstr ""

#. Need at least some presence
#. Medium ships here
#. Hau = maori unisex name that means wind
msgid "Elder Hau"
msgstr "侯长老"

msgid ""
"\"Do you feel the ebb of the universe? Only through harmony will we surpass "
"our frail selves.\""
msgstr "\"你感觉到宇宙的退潮了吗？只有通过和谐，我们才能超越脆弱的自我。\""

msgid "You shall make a good sacrifice to my bioship!"
msgstr "你要为我的生物飞船做出一个很好的牺牲！"

msgid "\"We do not deal with the tainted.\""
msgstr "\"我们不与受污染的人打交道。\""

#. Irala = maori unisex name that means god wrestler
msgid "Witch Doctor Irala"
msgstr "巫医伊拉拉"

msgid "\"The sky omens indicate troubled times ahead.\""
msgstr "\"天空的预兆预示着未来的困难时期。\""

msgid "You disrupt the order of nature!"
msgstr "你扰乱了自然秩序！"

msgid "Warrior Renata"
msgstr ""

msgid "\"These are troubled times. Keep safe wanderer.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Finally, a challenge!"
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Do not patronize me with your grubby credits.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Mosi the Spry"
msgstr ""

msgid "\"I've always wanted to try to eat some jellywhale.\""
msgstr ""

msgid "Your head shall make a good trophy."
msgstr ""

msgid "\"Credits will not get me a fluffier tail!\""
msgstr ""

