msgstr "太慢了"

msgid ""
"This shipment must arrive within {time_limit}, but it will take at least "
"{time} for your ship to reach {pnt}, missing the deadline. Accept the "
"mission anyway?"
msgstr ""
"此货件必须在{time_limit}内到达，但您的货件至少需要{time}才能到达{pnt}，从而错"
"过最后期限。还是要接受任务吗？"

