#.
#. Freeing Kex 3
#.
#. Go to planet A, get ambushed twice, and then duel in the Crimson Gauntlet.
#. --
#. Mission states:
#. nil: mission not accepted yet
#. 0: mission accepted go to targetplanet and try to find dvaered dude
