msgid ""
"An O'rez traitor known as {pilotname} has gained notoriety through violent "
"acts against House Yetmer in the {sys} system. Their elimination will help "
"the war efforts to triumph over the traitors.\n"
"\n"
"#nTarget:#0 {pilotname} ({shipclass}-class ship{escorts})\n"
