#~ msgid "Deals 300 plasma damage to all hostile ships in 200 range."
#~ msgstr "对200射程内的所有敌方船只造成300点等离子伤害。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This bay allows your ship to carry four Thurion Perspicacity fighters. It "
#~ "comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and flight of the "
#~ "fighters."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这个海舱允许您的船运载四名瑟里昂(Thurion)洞察者战斗机。它配备了战斗机维护"
#~ "和飞行所需的所有设备。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "This dock allows your ship to carry a pair of Thurion Perspicacity "
#~ "fighters. It comes with all the devices required for the maintenance and "
#~ "flight of the fighters."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这个船坞允许你的飞船携带两个瑟里昂(Thurion)洞察者战斗机。它配备了战斗机维"
#~ "护和飞行所需的所有设备。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Most ships are designed with ample tolerances around the hyperdrive fuel "
#~ "tanks, in order to avoid unhappy surprises to the captain. However, most "
#~ "expert ship engineers will tell you they're not actually necessary, "
#~ "although few will actually go through the trouble and responsibility to "
#~ "retool ship's hyperdrive making it a rare modification to find.\n"
#~ "#oThis outfit can not be removed once equipped.#0"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "大多数飞船在超光引擎燃料箱周围设计了充足的公差，以避免给船长带来意外惊喜。"
#~ "然而，大多数经验丰富的飞船工程师会告诉你，这些公差实际上并非必要，尽管很少"
#~ "有人愿意承担改造飞船超光引擎的责任，因此#o这种改造非常罕见。#0"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "This licence will authorize you to do mercenary missions and, more "
#~ "importantly, collect bounties."
#~ msgstr "这张许可证将授权你执行雇佣军任务，更重要的是，收取赏金。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "By improving your ship's stabilization systems drastically, this "
#~ "modification will allow you to reach higher speeds while still keeping "
#~ "the ship stable. As another side effect, the improved stabilizers "
#~ "allowing reversing the thrusters with a small loss of thrust."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "通过大幅改善你的船的稳定系统，这种修改将允许你达到更高的速度，同时仍然保持"
#~ "舰船稳定。作为另一个副作用，改进的稳定器允许反向推进器的推力损失很小。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A ship without structural integrity is floating space junk. However, most "
#~ "modern building standards are usually designed around worst-case "
#~ "scenarios with with significant reinforcement. While this does make the "
#~ "ship much more robust, it can be overkill for those not expected to be in "
#~ "combat. Newer nanofiber materials can also suit the job without "
#~ "compromising structural integrity, allowing replacing parts of the ship's "
#~ "structural panels with much lighter ones, significantly reducing the "
#~ "mass. It does come with a big disclaimer saying it is not suited for "
#~ "combat, but that is more like a suggestion, right?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "一艘缺乏结构完整性的飞船不过是漂浮在太空中的垃圾。然而，大多数现代建筑标准"
#~ "通常都是围绕最坏情况设计的，具有显著的加强结构。虽然这确实使飞船更加坚固，"
#~ "但对于那些不预期参与战斗的飞船来说，这可能有些过于夸张。新型纳米纤维材料也"
#~ "可以胜任这项工作，同时不会影响结构完整性，允许用更轻的材料替换飞船结构面板"
#~ "的部分，从而大幅降低质量。它确实附带了一个大免责声明，说明它不适合战斗，但"
#~ "这更像是一个建议，对吧？"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Gives +30% shield regeneration to all friendly ships within 3000 units. "
#~ "Range is affected by detection bonus."
#~ msgstr "对所有3000单位内的友军舰船给予+30%的护盾回复。射程受侦察加值影响。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The ZD-5 Guardian Unit is designed as a last resort defence system. It "
#~ "strong magnetic fields to forcibly keep the ship hull integrity as long "
#~ "as energy can hold out. The small layout limits the maximum damage the "
#~ "unit can compensate. Originally meant to be used for next generation "
#~ "Za'lek drones, although the reasons are not very clear, the project was "
#~ "cancelled only very few experimental models exist."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "ZD-5型守护单元被设计为终极防御系统，通过强力磁场在能量耗尽前强行维持舰体完"
#~ "整性。其紧凑结构限制了该装置的最大损伤补偿能力。原本计划用于扎列克(Za'lek)"
#~ "次世代无人机，虽然原因不明，但项目已终止，仅存少量实验型号。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "When the Empire replaced their ageing cruisers with the new Hawking class "
#~ "House Dvaered seized the opportunity to acquire the licence for the "
#~ "cruiser and most of the remaining ships. Dvaered engineers reinforced the "
#~ "armour and redesigned the ship's structure while also attaching "
#~ "additional weapon hard points. Afterwards, the ship was renamed to "
#~ "Retribution. However, the electronics remained outdated."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当帝国用新的霍金级替换他们老化的巡洋舰时，戴瓦德(Dvaered)家族抓住机会获得"
#~ "了巡洋舰和大部分剩余船只的执照。分散的工程师加固了装甲，重新设计了飞船的结"
#~ "构，同时还安装了额外的武器硬点。后来，这艘船被重新命名为报应号。然而，这些"
#~ "电子产品仍然过时。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This military grade version of the Vigilance has an optimized weight "
#~ "distribution allowing it to carry more payload."
#~ msgstr "这款军用版本的警戒具有优化的重量分布，使其能够携带更多有效载荷。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This military grade version of the Hawking is mostly identical in "
#~ "function to a standard Hawking, but with slightly better armour, and "
#~ "shields."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这种军规版的Hawking在功能上与标准版几乎完全相同，但装甲和护盾稍有增强。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Built under contract for the Empire by Nexus Shipyards, the Peacemaker is "
#~ "one of the grandest vessels in the galaxy, dwarfing even the mighty "
#~ "Goddard. Peacemakers typically function as flag ships in Imperial fleets, "
#~ "and can provide the fighter and bomber squadrons with much needed "
#~ "resupplies. Like most capital ships, however, it is vulnerable to attack "
#~ "from enemy bombers."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "根据纳克西斯(Nexus)造船厂为帝国建造的合同，和平缔造者号是银河系最宏伟的船"
#~ "只之一，甚至使强大的戈达德(Goddard)号相形见绌。和平缔造者通常在帝国舰队中"
#~ "充当旗舰，可以为战斗机和轰炸机中队提供急需的补给。然而，像大多数首都舰艇一"
#~ "样，它很容易受到敌人轰炸机的攻击。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Llama's popularity is based on the wide availability of the base "
#~ "ship, and is most pilots introduction to spacefaring. Inspired by the "
#~ "popularity, Melendez Corporation released a premium series nicknamed "
#~ "Voyager. Although the new model nearly sports double the price tag, it "
#~ "comes with more efficient hyperdrive coupling, and more importantly, a "
#~ "built-in fuel ramscoop that is able to capture and filter minuscule space "
#~ "dust to slowly refill fuel."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "拉玛的受欢迎程度是基于基地船的广泛可用性，并且是大多数飞行员对航天的介绍。"
#~ "受到流行的启发，梅伦德斯(Melendez)公司发布了一个绰号为Voyager的高级系列。"
#~ "尽管新型号的价格几乎是原来的两倍，但它配备了更高效的超空间驱动器耦合，更重"
#~ "要的是，内置燃料助推器，能够捕获和过滤微小的太空尘埃以缓慢补充燃料。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "When all your care about cargo, the Plowshare is the vessel you need. By "
#~ "minimizing defence capabilities, the plowshare is able to dedicate most "
#~ "of the ship's volume to cargo holds, allowing it to carry incredible "
#~ "amount of cargo. However, this also limits their movements to safe areas, "
#~ "which is why they are commonly seen only on trade lanes. Plowshares play "
#~ "a fundamental role in the distribution of low cost goods around the "
#~ "universe and are one of the cornerstones of modern spacefaring societies."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当您关心货物时，犁铧就是您需要的船只。通过最大限度地减少防御能力，犁地犁能"
#~ "够将舰船的大部分体积用于货舱，使其能够运载令人难以置信的数量的货物。然而，"
#~ "这也限制了它们在安全区域的移动，这就是为什么它们通常只在贸易通道上出现。犁"
#~ "头在宇宙中低成本商品的分销中发挥着基础作用，也是现代航天社会的基石之一。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A collector's model of the Melendez Quicksilver Courier. This model "
#~ "boasts and much improved engine interface that overcomes much of the "
#~ "limitations of the standard model. Furthermore, a state-of-the-art "
#~ "hyperdrive allows for instant jumping, one of the most popular features "
#~ "of the model. As if it wasn't enough, the finish on the hull uses "
#~ "strategic patterns and reflective materials that can confuse weapon "
#~ "tracking. As expected, the ship comes with a heft price tag that many can "
#~ "not afford."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "梅伦德斯(Melendez)「快银」信使舰典藏版。本型号搭载革命性的神经直连引擎交互"
#~ "系统，彻底克服了标准版的量子过载瓶颈。更配备晶格谐振超驱核心，实现真正意义"
#~ "上的零预热瞬跳——此功能长期占据星际典当行热搜榜首。若仅此而已尚不足显其珍，"
#~ "舰体幻纹镀层采用全向偏光装甲技术，能诱导至少87%的制导武器误判弹道。当然，"
#~ "此等尤物自然匹配天价配额，寻常空港债券交易员连舰艉涂装的分子涂料都负担不"
#~ "起。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The stock Admonisher is a powerful vessel, especially for its size. "
#~ "Through the usual Skull and Bones refit the Pirate Admonisher features "
#~ "improved manoeuvrability, more weapons space and slightly improved "
#~ "defences, at a cost of cargo capacity and shielding power."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "库存训诫者是一个强大的工具，特别是就它的规模而言。通过通常的骷髅和骨头"
#~ "(S&B)改装，海盗告诫者的特点是更好的机动性，更多的武器空间和略微改进的防"
#~ "御，但代价是货物能力和装甲再生率。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Zebra, one of the largest freighters available for independent "
#~ "civilian traders, was refitted by Skull and Bones to serve as carrier. "
#~ "Large portions of the cargo bays were left out to harden the hull or "
#~ "repurposed as hangars; those hangars have to operate in a scarily "
#~ "makeshift manner, slowing fighter maintienance substantially, but on the "
#~ "flipside, releasing the fighters is hardly more involved than jettisoning "
#~ "unwanted cargo, making it quick to respond to sudden threats. Although "
#~ "its capacity for cargo ends up suboptimal, the pirate version of the "
#~ "Zebra is used as a freighter occasionally."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "斑马号是可供独立民用贸易商使用的最大货船之一，由骷髅和骨头(S&B)改装为承运"
#~ "人。大部分货舱被改造为机库，因此货运能力明显降低。不过，海盗版的斑马偶尔也"
#~ "会被用作货船。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "While smaller and less intimidating than its bigger siblings in the "
#~ "Proteron arsenal, a pack of Daltons is still a foe to be reckoned with. "
#~ "It's the latest in a long line of largely carrier-based interceptors. The "
#~ "Dalton's armour shell can be retracted and functions as cargo box for "
#~ "more convenient handling and storage. Packing relatively little "
#~ "firepower, they're ill-suited to duelling, but a carrier group unleashing "
#~ "several squadrons has been known to turn the tide of battle on many "
#~ "occasions."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "虽然比普罗特伦(Proteron)军火库中更大的兄弟姐妹更小，更不可怕，但一群达顿"
#~ "(Dalton)仍然是一个不可忽视的敌人。这是一长串主要基于航母的拦截器中最新的一"
#~ "个。达顿(Dalton)的装甲壳可以收回，并作为货物箱的功能，更方便的处理和存储。"
#~ "由于携带的火力相对较少，它们不适合决斗，但一个航母战斗群释放几个中队在许多"
#~ "情况下都能扭转战局。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Thurion Ingenuity is a fighter built for survival. Like all Thurian "
#~ "ships, it puts defensive capabilities first and offensive capabilities "
#~ "second. However, by no means is the Ingenuity a poor combat craft. It is "
#~ "capable of staying in combat and slugging it out, and when things get too "
#~ "hot, it can quickly retreat to recharge and regenerate. Also, like every "
#~ "Thurian ship, the electronics are well above average."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "瑟里昂(Thurion)机智是一种为生存而生的战士。像所有的瑟里昂(Thurion)舰艇一"
#~ "样，它把防御能力放在第一位，进攻能力放在第二位。然而，这种独创性绝不是一种"
#~ "糟糕的作战方式。它能够留在战斗中并一决雌雄，当情况变得太热时，它可以迅速后"
#~ "退，进行充电和再生。此外，像每一艘瑟里昂(Thurion)船只一样，电子设备也远远"
#~ "高于平均水平。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "House Za'lek's ferociously-named destroyer has earned the moniker with "
#~ "disproportionately powerful shields and energy management, as well as "
#~ "size. Its handling suffers and it has poor armour, like all Za'lek ships, "
#~ "but this comes as little consolation to the Za'lek's enemies."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "扎列克(Za'lek)家族这艘凶悍命名的驱逐舰以其不成比例的强力护盾、能量管理系统"
#~ "及体型赢得了称号。与所有扎列克(Za'lek)舰船一样，其操控性欠佳且装甲薄弱，但"
#~ "这对其敌人而言几乎算不上安慰。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Ceded to House Yetmer-O'rez and named after the first-born heir Amlet "
#~ "Yetmer-O'rez, Amletia was meant to be the secondary planet of the House, "
#~ "a safe place to raise children. However, after the intra-house war "
#~ "started, the local infrastructure has been forced to transition from "
#~ "luxurious housing and second homes to industrial infrastructure to "
#~ "support the war efforts. As can be expected, this has had a large toll on "
#~ "the quality of life on the planet over the long number of cycles that "
#~ "have passed since the fighting began. It is not uncommon for sirens to "
#~ "sound when enemy ships enter the system, but it seems like most people "
#~ "have gotten used to and mostly ignore them as they go about their "
#~ "business.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Ametlia was heavily hit during the beginning of the war, coming under "
#~ "siege by House O'rez. However, it was nearly miraculously overcome by a "
#~ "small fleet that was able to break the blockade and liberate the planet. "
#~ "The pilots are still revered as heroes to this day with a prominent "
#~ "statue at the space port. A lot of the damage done then is still visible "
#~ "throughout the planet surface."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Amletia 被割让给Yetmer-O'rez家族，并以家族长子Amletia Yetmer-O'rez的名字命"
#~ "名，原本是作为家族的次要行星，一个养育后代的安全场所。然而，随着家族内战的"
#~ "爆发，当地的基础设施被迫从豪华住宅和度假屋转型为支持战时努力的工业设施。正"
#~ "如预期的那样，自战斗开始以来，经过漫长的周期，这对行星上的生活质量造成了巨"
#~ "大影响。当敌舰进入系统时，警报声响起并不少见，但似乎大多数人已经习惯了，继"
#~ "续忙于自己的事务，大多忽略了警报。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "战争初期，Amletia 遭受了重创，被O'rez家族围攻。然而，一支小型舰队奇迹般地"
#~ "突破了封锁，解放了行星，几乎可以说是奇迹。这些飞行员至今仍被视为英雄，太空"
#~ "港上矗立着他们的巨大雕像。当时造成的许多破坏至今仍清晰可见，遍布整个行星表"
#~ "面。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "What was once the Amlet Bistro has been replaced with a more practical "
#~ "Yetmer Cantina. The outer building is spectacularly lavish, however, half "
#~ "of the it has had to be replaced due to a near-direct hit by a bomb at "
#~ "the beginning of the war. The insides have been reinforced with ship "
#~ "panels to give more protection to the clients at a low cost. Usually, the "
#~ "bar is crowded with weary pilots between their patrol and attack shifts. "
#~ "The few non-locals tend to mind their own business as much as possible "
#~ "and leave as soon as they can."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "曾经的Amlet酒廊已被更实用的叶特默食堂取代。外立面华丽非凡，然而由于战争初"
#~ "期一颗炸弹几乎直接命中，一半的建筑不得不被重建。内部则用船板加固，以低成本"
#~ "为顾客提供更好的保护。通常，酒吧里挤满了疲惫的飞行员，在他们的巡逻和攻击任"
#~ "务之间稍作休息。少数非本地人则尽可能地专注于自己的事务，并尽快离开。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This simple refining plant is where the ore collected on Andors is turned "
#~ "into a more useful form and shipped out to other worlds to be turned into "
#~ "whatever is needed. The entire station is heavily automated with only the "
#~ "bare minimum of staff manning the station. Work consists mainly in the "
#~ "maintenance of the droids and playing card games."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这个简单的精炼厂将安德斯上收集的矿石转化为更有用的形式，并运往其他世界，以"
#~ "转化为所需的任何东西。整个空间站高度自动化，只有最低限度的工作人员在空间站"
#~ "工作。工作主要是维护机器人和玩纸牌游戏。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Belltower Nest is a small Soromid military outpost whose main purpose is "
#~ "to keep the Adiadus system in line. Being this far from the Soromid core "
#~ "there is little interstellar traffic, some of the inhabitants "
#~ "occasionally start to wonder if they're really part of the Soromid "
#~ "collective at all. Belltower is here to remind them that they are."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Belltower Nest是索洛米德(Soromid)的一个小型军事前哨，其主要目的是保持"
#~ "Adiadus 系统的正常运行。由于距离索洛米德(Soromid)核心如此之远，几乎没有星"
#~ "际交通，一些居民偶尔会开始怀疑他们是否真的是索洛米德(Soromid)集体的一部"
#~ "分。钟楼在这里是为了提醒他们，他们是。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "As Aesir is so far away and many government services are better rendered "
#~ "locally than over a distance of many hyperspace jumps, Burnan serves as "
#~ "the local capital in this sector of Sirius space. Because of this, the "
#~ "primary city of Burnan sports an atypically large political district in "
#~ "its primary city, as well as one of the largest Sirian temples in all of "
#~ "Sirius space.\n"
#~ "Due to the highly political nature of the planet, the cities and "
#~ "districts are designed with specific echelons in mind, and mixing is kept "
#~ "to a minimum."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "由于Aesir 很远，而且许多政府服务都是在当地提供的，比起跨越许多超空间跳跃的"
#~ "距离，伯南是天狼星空间这一部分的当地首府。正因为如此，伯南的主要城市在其主"
#~ "要城市中拥有一个非典型的大政治区，以及天狼星空间中最大的天狼星寺庙之一。\n"
#~ "由于地球的高度政治性，城市和地区的设计考虑到了特定的梯队，混合被保持在最低"
#~ "限度。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Although originally small-time calm world, the Nebula has stripped away "
#~ "most of the atmosphere making it nearly unlivable. Most of the "
#~ "inhabitants have long since left, and the Empire has officially declared "
#~ "it a ruined world, however, some stubborn individuals still persist and "
#~ "survive in a mainly self-sufficient outside of what could be considered "
#~ "civilized society. The locals mainly live in the underground "
#~ "installations around the spaceport, using the abandoned spacious "
#~ "accommodations freely."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "尽管这个世界最初是一个小时候平静的世界，但它已经剥离了大部分大气层，使其几"
#~ "乎无法居住。大多数居民早已离开，帝国正式宣布这里为一个毁灭的世界，然而，一"
#~ "些顽固的个人仍然坚持并生存在一个基本自给自足的文明社会之外。当地人主要居住"
#~ "在太空港周围的地下设施中，自由地使用废弃的宽敞住宿。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Being a small moon in an already growing system fewer colonists have paid "
#~ "attention to Corvus VI-b - the name itself is a bit of a giveaway. "
#~ "However the colonists of this moon appreciate its larger neighbours "
#~ "which, inadvertently, provide protection by being more important, juicier "
#~ "and more obvious targets."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "作为成长中星系里的小卫星，Corvus VI-b鲜受殖民者关注——其名称本身已说明问"
#~ "题。然而该卫星的殖民者庆幸拥有更显眼的邻近星体，这些更关键、更诱人的目标在"
#~ "无意中为其提供了保护屏障。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Drunken Lobster has a plaque commemorating the time the Emperor spent "
#~ "on Em 5. It seems unlikely he ever visited this bar, though, given its "
#~ "less than refined patrons and threadbare furniture."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "醉龙虾餐厅有一块牌匾，纪念皇帝在Em 5度过的时光。不过，考虑到这家酒吧的顾客"
#~ "不够精致，家具也破旧，他似乎不太可能去过这家酒吧。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Holly system is one of those statistical flukes that is almost bound "
#~ "to happen somewhere in the galaxy. Holly III is one of the trinary "
#~ "planetary system that currently exists here. Scientists have long "
#~ "predicted that the system will become unstable, especially with all the "
#~ "mining activity over the years, but there has been no appreciable change "
#~ "and so the miners continue, many arguing that their activities are "
#~ "actually contributing to the stability here!\n"
#~ "Holly III, Holly II and Holly I were named by the original mining pioneer "
#~ "who either had no imagination or an obsession and having since never been "
#~ "renamed by the miners that congregate here, possibly as a reminder of the "
#~ "that they should only tally in this system while they make large sums "
#~ "mining the ore-rich surfaces of the planets and then move on lest they "
#~ "also succumb. Due to this concentration of miners, the galaxy's largest "
#~ "mining guild, the Mining Vrata, established its headquarters in the "
#~ "system."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Holly星系是银河系中几乎必然存在的统计异常之一。Holly III是目前存在于这里的"
#~ "联星行星系统之一。科学家们早就预言这个星系会变得不稳定，特别是经过多年的采"
#~ "矿活动后，但至今没有明显变化，因此矿工们继续开采，许多人甚至认为他们的活动"
#~ "实际上有助于维持这里的稳定！\n"
#~ "Holly III、Holly II和Holly I由最初的采矿先驱命名，这位先驱要么缺乏想象力，"
#~ "要么有某种执念。聚集在此的矿工们从未更改这些名称，或许是为了提醒自己：只应"
#~ "在这个星系短暂停留，开采富含矿石的行星表面获取巨额利润后就离开，以免重蹈覆"
#~ "辙。由于矿工的高度集中，银河系最大的采矿公会Mining Vrata将其总部设在了这个"
#~ "星系。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Trim and functional, the bar here is situated in the central growing dome "
#~ "of INSS-1. The windows look out on vast stretches of multi-layered crop "
#~ "beds, and there's always a harvester to be seen at work somewhere out "
#~ "there."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "修剪和功能，这里的酒吧位于中央生长穹顶的INSS-1。窗户向外望去，可以看到一望"
#~ "无际的多层农作物床，总能看到一台收割机在外面的某个地方工作。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Trim and functional, the bar here is situated in the central growing dome "
#~ "of INSS-2. The windows look out on vast stretches of multi-layered crop "
#~ "beds, and there's always a harvester to be seen at work somewhere out "
#~ "there."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这里的酒吧既整洁又实用，位于INSS-2的中央生长穹顶。窗户向外望去，可以看到一"
#~ "望无际的多层农作物床，总能看到一台收割机在外面的某个地方工作。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Jorlan is one of the least successful Frontier worlds. Its colony ship, "
#~ "Santa Maria, arrived to find a barren, desolate rock that had next to no "
#~ "potential for human inhabitants. But with the only other reachable planet "
#~ "being a gas giant, Santa Maria's captain was faced with the choice to "
#~ "settle or perish. Somehow, his expedition has managed to eke out an "
#~ "existence on Jorlan.\n"
#~ "Jorlan's inhabitants are mostly part of the ore refining process, as it "
#~ "supplies most of the Frontier with all sorts of alloys. Gas miners are "
#~ "also sent to Haleb IV every few dozen decaperiods when the weather "
#~ "conditions are favourable."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Jorlan 是最不成功的边疆世界之一。它的殖民地船圣玛丽亚号抵达时发现了一块贫"
#~ "瘠、荒凉的岩石，几乎没有人类居住的潜力。但由于唯一可以到达的另一颗行星是一"
#~ "颗气体巨星，圣玛丽亚的船长面临着要么定居要么灭亡的选择。不知何故，他的探险"
#~ "队设法在Jorlan 上勉强维持了生存。\n"
#~ "Jorlan 的居民大多是矿石精炼过程的一部分，因为它为边疆的大部分地区提供了各"
#~ "种合金。当天气条件有利时，天然气矿工也每隔几十个十年被送往Haleb IV."

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "An extremely active molten planet with only small rocky floating islands "
#~ "to land on. You can only land on the largest ones, as most seem unable of "
#~ "supporting your ship's mass. To go outside and test your space suit's "
#~ "thermal resistance would be unwise."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "一个极其活跃的熔岩行星，只有少数小岩石漂浮岛屿可以着陆。你只能降落在最大的"
#~ "岛屿上，因为大多数岛屿似乎无法支撑你的飞船重量。你真的不希望出去测试你的太"
#~ "空服的耐热性。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Though life on Neurri is tough, the planet has nevertheless evolved to "
#~ "one of the most prominent pieces of real estate in Soromid space. "
#~ "Kataka's presence implies that Feye gets a lot of traffic, so "
#~ "economically Neurri is in a good position. The world mostly subsists on "
#~ "rendering services to Kataka, though a modest private ship building "
#~ "company has settled here as well."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "尽管纽里(Neurri)生存环境严酷，这颗行星却已成为索罗米德(Soromid)势力范围内"
#~ "最炙手可热的战略要地之一。卡塔卡(Kataka)的存在为菲耶(Feye)星系带来大量航运"
#~ "流量，使得纽里在经济上占据优势地位。该星球主要依靠为卡塔卡提供服务维持经"
#~ "济，不过一家中等规模的私营造船企业也在此设立了分部。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Once a highly prosperous planet of the old Empire, Uhrabi-9 was "
#~ "tragically struck by a large asteroid; the subsequently unstable volcanic "
#~ "activity reduced the planet to a lifeless state.\n"
#~ "Steiner was originally one of the satellites previously used by the "
#~ "people of Uhrabi-9, but following the loss of the planet Steiner expanded "
#~ "large enough to be classified as a station. It is now a popular tourist "
#~ "spot due to its proximity to Uhrabi-9."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "乌赫拉比-9(Uhrabi-9)曾经是旧帝国的一个高度繁荣的星球，不幸地被一颗大小行星"
#~ "击中；随后不稳定的火山活动使地球陷入无生命的状态。\n"
#~ "施泰纳最初是乌拉比-9号上的人以前使用的卫星之一，但在这颗行星消失后，施泰纳"
#~ "的规模扩大到足以被归类为空间站。由于靠近乌拉比9号，它现在是一个受欢迎的旅"
#~ "游景点。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Tepdania Prime was originally established by advances in technology "
#~ "allowed by Project Za'lek, before it would become Great House Za'lek. The "
#~ "planet is a J-class Gas Giant with an incredibly dense core formed of "
#~ "rare minerals and resources surrounded by a dense acidic atmosphere. The "
#~ "spaceport and only city of Tepdania Prime is located in a geostationary "
#~ "orbit inside the atmosphere, and protects itself from the local "
#~ "environment by an adaptively tuned shielding unit. The only entrance "
#~ "through the shielding unit is located in the aft and precise manoeuvres "
#~ "are needed to get in and out. Specialized drones are used to guides the "
#~ "ships as a single mistake can easily cause the entire ship to spiral into "
#~ "the core. Despite the precariousness of the entire set-up, it is "
#~ "incredible well-designed and has continued with little to no modification "
#~ "since its inception. Mining of the core is done by special drones, and "
#~ "most of the work on the station is around the maintenance of said drones. "
#~ "Given that much of the technology used is not well understood and "
#~ "incompatible with modern approaches, there are no plans to replace or "
#~ "refurbish the station, which, once fails, will return Tepdania Prime to "
#~ "its original uncolonized state."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "特普达尼亚主星最初由扎列克(Za'lek)计划带来的技术进步所建立，之后才成为扎列"
#~ "克(Za'lek)大家族。该星球是一颗J级气态巨行星，其核心由稀有矿物和资源构成密"
#~ "度极高，周围环绕着浓密的酸性大气层。特普达尼亚主星唯一的太空站及城市位于大"
#~ "气层内的地球同步轨道上，通过自适应调节的护盾装置抵御恶劣环境。护盾装置的唯"
#~ "一入口位于尾部，进出需要精确操控。专用无人机负责引导飞船，因为任何微小失误"
#~ "都可能导致整艘船螺旋坠入核心。尽管整个设施充满风险，但其设计精妙绝伦，自建"
#~ "成以来几乎未作修改。核心采矿作业由特殊无人机执行，空间站大部分工作都围绕这"
#~ "些无人机的维护展开。鉴于所用技术深奥难懂且与现代方法不兼容，目前没有重建或"
#~ "翻新计划。一旦设施失效，特普达尼亚主星将回归原始的未殖民状态。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wunomi's World is an old world that was colonized early for its "
#~ "similarity with the now-gone Earth. However, unlike Earth, the governor "
#~ "wanted to keep the planet in a less developed state, conserving much of "
#~ "its natural fauna and beauty. Development was then taken to space, in "
#~ "which an enormous geostationary ring was built, known as Wunomi's Ring. "
#~ "Only few cities remain down on the surface, with much of the focus on "
#~ "managing tourism. Most of the population lives in the ring which has "
#~ "gotten slightly crowded with the Incident. However, Wunomi's World acts "
#~ "as an important local trade hub, and work is still plentiful due to a "
#~ "somewhat strict population control system designed to conserve the planet "
#~ "and by extension ring's characteristic nature.\n"
#~ "As most of the population and cities are located on the ring instead of "
#~ "the planet, it is closer to a station than a planet. Low gravity allows "
#~ "for easy transpiration of bulk goods and encourages the sale of ships. "
#~ "For this reason, it is easy to find many supplies tailored for traders."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Wunomi's World是一个旧世界，因为它与现在消失的地球相似，很早就被殖民了。然"
#~ "而，与地球不同的是，州长希望让地球保持在一个不太发达的状态，保护它的大部分"
#~ "自然动物和美丽。然后，发展被带到了太空，在那里建造了一个巨大的地球静止轨道"
#~ "环，被称为乌诺米环。只有几个城市留在了地面上，大部分精力都放在了管理旅游业"
#~ "上。大多数人生活在这个因这起事件而变得略显拥挤的环内。然而，Wunomi's World"
#~ "是一个重要的当地贸易中心，由于有一个相当严格的人口控制系统来保护地球，进而"
#~ "延伸到环的特征性质，工作仍然很多。由于大多数人口和城市都位于环上，而不是行"
#~ "星上，所以它更接近空间站而不是行星。低重力使散装货物易于蒸腾，并鼓励船舶销"
#~ "售。出于这个原因，很容易找到许多为贸易商量身定做的供应。"

