#~ msgstr "戴瓦德(Dvaered)-索洛米德(Soromid)贸易航线"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You walk through the eerie station, surprised at how nebula crystals are "
#~ "growing into it, penetrating completely the walls, and make your way "
#~ "through the hallways. The station is picked clean, and you feel like you "
#~ "are wasting your time."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你穿过诡异的空间站，惊讶于星云水晶是如何生长在里面的，完全穿透了墙壁，穿过"
#~ "了走廊。空间站被挑得干干净净，你觉得自己是在浪费时间。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Eventually, you find a narrow passage, hidden between some nebula "
#~ "crystals and you manage to barely squeeze through after a couple of "
#~ "intents. You find what seems to be a crusty old terminal, you brush some "
#~ "of the dust and debris off of it and are surprised to see that it seems "
#~ "to still work."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "最终，你发现了一条隐藏在星云晶体之间的狭窄通道，在几次意向之后，你勉强挤了"
#~ "过去。你发现了一个看起来像是破旧的航站楼，你擦去了上面的一些灰尘和碎片，然"
#~ "后惊讶地发现它似乎还在工作。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Your viewscreen flashes to life. You're greeted by a nondescript pilot "
#~ "who doesn't seem to be affiliated with anyone you know."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "您的视屏将栩栩如生。迎接你的是一个不起眼的飞行员，他似乎与你认识的任何人都"
#~ "没有关联。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Or it could be the Toni's Discount Ship Repair Certification Course I "
#~ "did for {cost} in a back-alley on Darkshed. Still never really understood "
#~ "why we need to slap fish skin on the radiators. Bug juice would work much "
#~ "better, but anyway, I got my licence and I get spruce up your ship for "
#~ "all your space needs!\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"或者这可能是我在Darkshed的后巷为{cost}举办的托尼折扣舰船维修认证课程。仍"
#~ "然从未真正理解为什么我们需要在散热器上贴鱼皮。虫虫汁效果会更好，但无论如"
#~ "何，我拿到了驾照，我会为你的船打扮一番，以满足你所有的空间需求！\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"You can easily tell the different echelons apart. Every Sirian citizen "
#~ "and soldier wears clothing appropriate to his or her echelon.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你可以很容易地区分出不同的梯队。每个天狼星公民和士兵都穿着与他或她的梯队相"
#~ "适应的衣服。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"You will have to disable the convoys before you can board them to "
#~ "access the data. It is unlikely that a single convoy will contain all the "
#~ "information we seek, so you will most likely have to board several. My "
#~ "analysis of your flying capabilities estimates over 80% chance of "
#~ "success. Gluckliche Reise.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"在登上车队访问数据之前，你必须先禁用车队。单个车队不太可能包含我们寻求的"
#~ "所有信息，因此您很可能必须登上多个车队。我对您的飞行能力的分析估计成功的机"
#~ "会超过80%。格鲁克利切·里斯。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You work your way through the crushed structure, and eventually find your "
#~ "way to what seems to be a working airlock. After fiddling with the "
#~ "controls, you are able to make your way into it and to what seemingly "
#~ "seems to be makeshift and surprisingly working area of the wreck. You "
#~ "make your way forward and eventually find yourself in what seems to be "
#~ "some sort of dirty cantina. You can see some ancient spoiled food and "
#~ "drink on the tables."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你用你的方式穿过被压碎的结构，最终找到了似乎是一个正常工作的气闸。摆弄完控"
#~ "制装置后，你就可以进入它，进入似乎是临时的、令人惊讶的残骸工作区。你继续前"
#~ "进，最终发现自己走进了一个看起来像是肮脏的酒吧。你可以在桌子上看到一些古老"
#~ "的变质的食物和饮料。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "They give a small cough.\n"
#~ "\"After the... the Incident, me and my crewmates, we thought we could "
#~ "pull through. We created a colony with the survivors on husk of what was "
#~ "left of the once glorious Protera. However, the worst was yet to come.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "他们发出轻微的咳嗽声。\n"
#~ "\"事件发生后，我和我的船员们认为我们可以渡过难关。我们与曾经辉煌的普洛特拉"
#~ "(Protera)残骸上的幸存者一起创建了一个殖民地。然而，最糟糕的还在后面。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"It started subtle, violent outbreaks, slight twitching, aversion to "
#~ "bathing, then it got worse. Eventually, they would lash out, attack "
#~ "everyone and everything in some sort of primal irrational rage. Having "
#~ "lost all their remaining humanity, we called the brutes the Lost.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"它开始了微妙的、暴力的爆发，轻微的抽搐，对洗澡的厌恶，然后情况变得更糟。"
#~ "最终，他们会猛烈攻击，以某种原始的非理性的愤怒攻击每个人和一切。在失去了所"
#~ "有剩余的人性后，我们称这些畜生为迷失的人。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"I knew you would say that.\n"
#~ "So, as the negotiations with Goddard shareholders is making progress, we "
#~ "identified another private person that needs to be… worked on. It is the "
#~ "very famous Baron Sauterfeldt, President of the recently-created "
#~ "Hereditary Democratic Republic of Ulios.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"我知道你会这么说。\n"
#~ "因此，随着与戈达德(Goddard)股东的谈判取得进展，我们确定了另一位需要……工作"
#~ "的私人人士。他是非常著名的索特费尔特男爵，最近成立的乌里奥斯世袭民主共和国"
#~ "的总统。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"The Baron is in not so cordial terms with the Imperial authorities "
#~ "(partially due to the fact that he declared Ulios independent not so long "
#~ "ago). By a complex alliance game, this might get him to back Lord "
#~ "Fatgun's views.\"\n"
#~ "\"He told me that he was impressed by the way the 'obstacle Agrippina "
#~ "Grosjean' was handled and needs us to provide him a pilot for some 'tiny "
#~ "special task' (those are his words). I have no idea what this task might "
#~ "be, but he required me to send you directly to {pnt} in {sys} to meet him."
#~ "\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"男爵与帝国当局的关系并不那么友好(部分原因是他不久前宣布乌利奥斯独立)。通"
#~ "过一个复杂的联盟游戏，这可能会让他支持胖枪勋爵的观点。\"\n"
#~ "\"他告诉我，他对‘阿格里皮娜·格罗斯让’的处理方式印象深刻，需要我们为他提供"
#~ "一名飞行员来执行一些‘微小的特殊任务’(这是他的话)。我不知道这个任务是什么，"
#~ "但他要求我直接派您到{sys}的{pnt}与他会面。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "After landing, you are approached by a group of well-dressed people: "
#~ "\"His Lordship, the Baron Sauterfeldt, will encounter you. Please follow "
#~ "us to the presidential palace.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "着陆后，一群衣冠楚楚的人向你走来:\"领主索特费尔特男爵会遇见你。请跟随我们"
#~ "前往总统府。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "They guide you to the urban transport station, and while a crowd of "
#~ "workers are waiting for the next train in a suffocating heat, you enter a "
#~ "small shuttle: \"His Lordship decided the creation of the hypervelocity "
#~ "shuttles system last cycle. Since then, this system saves much time to "
#~ "first-class citizen who used to get stuck in traffic jams or in over-"
#~ "crowded heliports. His genial idea was to use the same tunnel net as the "
#~ "subway.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "他们引导您到达城市交通站，当一群工人在令人窒息的高温中等待下一趟火车时，您"
#~ "进入了一辆小型班车:\"老爷上个周期决定创建超高速班车系统。从那时起，该系统"
#~ "为曾经陷入交通堵塞或过度拥挤的直升机场的头等公民节省了很多时间。他的好主意"
#~ "是使用与地铁相同的隧道网。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Suddenly, a huge holographic face appears in the centre of the room:\n"
#~ "\"Hello, and welcome on the planet Ulios, {player1}! I am the Baron Dovai "
#~ "Sauterfeldt. I hope you got a smooth travel to our very remote humble "
#~ "piece of land! I am truly delighted to meet you, {player2}, truly… Or did "
#~ "we already meet before? Mmmm! I am afraid I am perfectly incapable to "
#~ "remember most of the astonishingly inspiring people I tend to meet.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "突然，一个巨大的全息头像出现在房间的中央:\"你好，欢迎来到乌利奥斯星球，"
#~ "{player1}！我是索特费尔特男爵。我希望你一路顺利来到我们这个偏远的小地方！"
#~ "我真的很高兴见到你，{player2}，真的……还是我们以前见过？嗯！我恐怕完全无法"
#~ "记住我遇到的那些令人震惊的鼓舞人心的人。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The baron explains his plan: \"Hyena bikers will soon gather for a "
#~ "festival on {pnt} in {sys}. I want you to go there, find Blue Belly "
#~ "Billy, defy her in a Hyena duel, disable her ship, get her nozzle hubcap "
#~ "and come back.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这位男爵解释了他的计划:\"鬣狗骑手们很快就会聚集在一起，在{pnt}在{sys}举行"
#~ "一个节日。我要你去那里，找到蓝肚皮比利，在鬣狗决斗中挑战她，让她的船失灵，"
#~ "拿起她的喷嘴轮盖，然后回来。\""

#~ msgid "A member of the Big Bang Band"
#~ msgstr "大爆炸乐队的成员"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The leader of the fearsome bikers gang 'Big Bang Band' accepts to talk "
#~ "with you."
#~ msgstr "可怕的摩托车手团伙‘Big Bang Band’的头目接受了与你的交谈。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"The Hyena is much more than just an interceptor. It's a way of life: "
#~ "speed, adrenalin, and leather jackets. That ship is awesome and "
#~ "unforgiving: any error can be fatal when you fly it out there.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"鬣狗不只是一个拦截者。它是一种生活方式:速度、肾上腺素和皮夹克。这艘船令"
#~ "人敬畏，而且不可饶恕:当你在那里飞行时，任何错误都可能是致命的。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Of course, we are gangs! We make tons of totally criminal stuff! One "
#~ "day, I even parked my Hyena at a spot reserved for delivery ships!\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"当然，我们是帮派！我们制造了大量完全是犯罪的东西！有一天，我甚至把我的鬣"
#~ "狗停在了一个专门给快递船的地方！\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Actually, nothing tells me that you truly are a member of the Heavy "
#~ "Headbutt Gang. If you are, you'll have no problem to beat the Hallway to "
#~ "Hell challenge. Afterwards, I'll let you settle our affair with our "
#~ "leader Blue Belly Billy. I guess you will want to have a duel with her, "
#~ "no?\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"事实上，没什么能告诉我你真的是重头帮的一员。如果你是，你就可以毫不费力地"
#~ "去地狱挑战。之后，我会让你和我们的领袖蓝肚皮比利解决我们的事情。我想你会想"
#~ "和她决斗的，不是吗？\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"There are plenty of kinds of challenges! Some consist in doing "
#~ "acrobatic figures, other are races. There is also the 'Bad Boar Battle' "
#~ "challenge, it is the one you must beat to enter my gang: the Big Bang "
#~ "Band, and it consists in flying to Dvaer Prime, broadcasting messages of "
#~ "insults against House Dvaered, and then… if you manage to get to a "
#~ "civilized planet in one piece, you have beaten the challenge.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "“挑战有很多种！有些是特技飞行动作，有些是竞速赛。还有‘坏野猪之战’挑战，这"
#~ "是你加入我帮派‘大爆炸乐队’必须通过的考验:需要飞到戴瓦德(Dvaered)主星，广播"
#~ "辱骂戴瓦德(Dvaered)家族的信息，然后...如果你能完整地逃到文明星球，就算挑战"
#~ "成功。”"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"If you want to approach Blue Belly Billy, you have to prove that you "
#~ "are worth of it. You need to cross the 'Hallway to Hell' inside a Hyena."
#~ "\"\n"
#~ "\"It is a very simple challenge in principle, but only few manage to make "
#~ "it alive through the Hallway to Hell. And even fewer manage to make it in "
#~ "a time short enough for Blue Belly Billy to accept them to defy her.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "如果你想接近蓝肚皮比利，你必须证明你值得这样做。你需要在一只鬣狗体内穿过"
#~ "‘地狱走廊’。\n"
#~ "\"从原则上讲，这是一个非常简单的挑战，但只有少数人能活着穿过走廊去地狱。更"
#~ "少的人能在足够短的时间内完成任务，让蓝肚皮比利接受他们的挑战。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Let me explain: there are 3 weak targets in a triangle, and you need to "
#~ "destroy all those 3 targets with your Hyena. Sounds pretty simple, no? "
#~ "But between those targets, there are platforms that fire fury missiles at "
#~ "you. You'll have to dodge the missiles and destroy the 3 buoys before the "
#~ "timer runs out… unless you are too scared for our challenge and you did "
#~ "already pee your pants.\n"
#~ "We are preparing the set. Just take off to start the challenge!\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "让我解释一下:一个三角形中有3个弱小的目标，你需要用你的鬣狗摧毁所有这3个目"
#~ "标。听起来很简单，不是吗？但在这些目标之间，有一些平台向你发射愤怒的导弹。"
#~ "你必须躲避导弹，在计时器用完之前摧毁3个浮标…除非你对我们的挑战太害怕了而且"
#~ "你已经尿裤子了。\n"
#~ "我们正在准备布景。只要起飞开始挑战就行了！\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Wow! you have beaten the Hallway to Hell challenge! That is quite "
#~ "impressive. I think you owned the right to get destroyed by Blue Belly "
#~ "Billy's Blasters!\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "哇！你赢了地狱挑战！这真是令人印象深刻。我认为你有权被蓝肚皮比利的爆破者摧"
#~ "毁！"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "We identified a shareholder whose name is Agrippina Grosjean. She is an "
#~ "allied of Lord Richthofen, and she will be firmly against us buying a "
#~ "second battlecruiser. This is why I have elaborated a negotiation plan "
#~ "that consists in eliminating her. What do you think of that negotiation "
#~ "plan?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我们确定了一位股东的名字，他的名字是Agrippina Grosjean。她是里希特霍芬勋爵"
#~ "的盟友，她将坚决反对我们购买第二艘战斗巡洋舰。这就是为什么我制定了一项包括"
#~ "消除她的谈判计划。你对那个谈判计划有什么看法？"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The problem is that she tends to only attack Llamas as it is probably the "
#~ "less dangerous ship that exists. This means that you will have to fly "
#~ "such a ship for her to engage you. Now, you may wonder how you are "
#~ "supposed to catch her in a Llama if she decides to run away, and that is "
#~ "where the less legal part of the mission comes into play."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "问题是，她倾向于只攻击拉玛，因为它可能是现存的危险程度较低的船。这意味着你"
#~ "必须驾驶这样一艘船才能让她与你交战。现在，你可能会想，如果她决定逃跑，你怎"
#~ "么才能在一辆拉玛中抓住她，这就是任务中不那么合法的部分发挥作用的地方。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Colonel Okran guides you through narrow gangways. You arrive into a large "
#~ "hall and cross a checkpoint guarded by spider-cyborgs and Okran tells "
#~ "you: \"those are the soldiers of the 26th multi-terrain assault regiment "
#~ "(ground forces), they are deployed on this spaceport because our "
#~ "intelligence detected a high risk of FLF terrorist attack this sector in "
#~ "the close future. They look a bit odd with their biologically-grown and "
#~ "mechanically-enhanced pawns, but they are friendly… I mean mostly.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "奥克兰上校带你穿过狭窄的舷梯。你来到一个大厅，穿过一个由蜘蛛半机械人把守的"
#~ "检查站，奥克兰告诉你:\"他们是第26多地形突击团(地面部队)的士兵，他们被部署"
#~ "在这个航天港，因为我们的情报机构发现，在不久的将来，猛虎解放阵线对这一地区"
#~ "发动恐怖袭击的风险很高。他们的生物生长和机械增强的棋子看起来有点奇怪，但他"
#~ "们基本上是友好的…，我是说。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You finally arrive in a tiny ill-enlightened room, where a strange group "
#~ "is waiting for you. Two of them are much higher than average, wear an "
#~ "intimidating amount of implants on their skin, and carry impressive guns "
#~ "while the two other seem unarmed. All of them wear an incoherent "
#~ "assortment of colourful civilian clothes."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你终于来到了一个不开明的小房间，一群陌生的人在那里等着你。其中两人的身高远"
#~ "远高于平均水平，皮肤上戴着数量惊人的植入物，携带着令人印象深刻的枪支，而另"
#~ "外两人似乎手无寸铁。他们都穿着各式各样的五颜六色的平民服装。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Okran finally guides you to the spacedocks, where you find your ship "
#~ "back. The four soldiers enter it, carrying large backpacks. Before "
#~ "leaving, Okran tells you to meet him on {pnt} once the mission is "
#~ "completed. It is time to fly to {sys}."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "奥克兰最终带你去了太空码头，在那里你可以找到你的船回来。四名士兵背着大背包"
#~ "走了进来。在离开之前，奥克兰告诉你一旦任务完成，就在{pnt}上见他。又到了飞"
#~ "往{sys}的时候了。"

#~ msgid "\"Does the Imperial laws authorize strikes?\""
#~ msgstr "\"帝国法律授权罢工吗？\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"It is of the responsibility of Nexus docks to do all that is needed to "
#~ "satisfy their clients. And this includes providing us workers (who "
#~ "actually do the work) with suitable wages. Nowadays, with our current "
#~ "remuneration, we had to work about 5 periods per decaperiod, and at this "
#~ "rhythm, non-modified workers start having severe health issues at the age "
#~ "of 20 cycles, while cyborgs tend to fall apart even earlier. This is why "
#~ "Nexus docks is the only one to blame for this situation and we workers "
#~ "have not to be accused to defend our right to live longer than 25 cycles "
#~ "and to feed our children without having to force them to work.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "纳克西斯(Nexus) Dock有责任做好让客户满意所需的一切。这包括为我们(实际从事"
#~ "工作的)工人提供适当的工资。如今，以我们目前的薪酬，我们每十年必须工作大约5"
#~ "个周期，按照这种节奏，未经改造的工人在20岁时就开始出现严重的健康问题，而半"
#~ "机械人往往更早崩溃。这就是为什么纳克西斯(Nexus) Ddocks是造成这种情况的唯一"
#~ "罪魁祸首，我们工人不必被指控捍卫我们活超过25个周期的权利，并在不必强迫他们"
#~ "工作的情况下养活我们的孩子。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Actually, nowadays, only few people really care about Imperial laws. "
#~ "All I know is that Nexus sent their private police after us when we "
#~ "created our labour union. Then we did throw large bolts at the cops, and "
#~ "they never came back. So I suppose what we do is legal.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"事实上，如今真正关心帝国法律的人寥寥无几。我所知道的是，当我们创建工会"
#~ "时，纳克西斯(Nexus)派了他们的私人警察来追捕我们。然后我们确实向警察投掷了"
#~ "大量弹药，他们再也没有回来。所以我想我们的做法是合法的。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Unexpected event, {player}. Some lazy workers are on strike, and the "
#~ "engine in question was not delivered to the warehouse. We managed to "
#~ "contact Colonel Okran and he got the information that it was sent to a "
#~ "secondary warehouse in Mural to avoid the strike. It is too late to get "
#~ "it there, but it will soon be transferred again. Let us go back to the "
#~ "ship: we will intercept it in {sys}.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"意外事件，{player}。一些懒惰的工人正在罢工，相关引擎未能交付到仓库。我们"
#~ "已联系奥克兰上校，他获悉该引擎被转移到穆拉尔的次级仓库以躲避罢工。现在前往"
#~ "那里已太迟，但它很快会被再次转运。让我们返回飞船:我们将在{sys}星系拦截它。"
#~ "\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "It appears the Siren of Halir did leave the system. Your mission is a "
#~ "failure!"
#~ msgstr "看来哈里尔的女妖确实离开了这个系统。你的任务失败了！"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When the 'Siren of Halir' is close enough, the members of the team leave "
#~ "your ship by the airlock and you wish them to safely reach the target. "
#~ "Once fuel transfer is finished, it is time for you to follow the Siren, "
#~ "waiting for the team to jump out of the ship."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当\"哈里尔的警报器\"足够近的时候，团队成员从气闸舱离开你的飞船，你希望他们"
#~ "安全到达目标。一旦燃料转移完成，你就可以跟随警报器，等待团队跳出飞船。"

#~ msgid "Empire Officer"
#~ msgstr "帝国官员"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You approach the Lt. Commander.\n"
#~ "   \"Hello {player}, we have a reconnaissance mission you might be "
#~ "interested in. Commander Soldner said you'd make a good candidate for the "
#~ "mission. You up for the challenge?\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你去接近少校指挥官。\n"
#~ "你好{player}，我们有一项侦察任务你可能会感兴趣。索德纳指挥官说你会是这个任"
#~ "务的很好的候选人。你准备好挑战了吗？"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"I don't think we've met. I'm Lt. Commander Dimitri. If all goes well, "
#~ "you'll be reporting to me for the next assignments.\n"
#~ "   \"You've heard about the Collective, right?  From what we know, the "
#~ "Collective seems to be a sort of 'hive' of robots. They're a recent "
#~ "menace; had the timing to arrive more or less when the Incident occurred, "
#~ "otherwise they would have been wiped out by the Emperor's Armada without "
#~ "a sweat. They completely wiped out all human life in Eiroik and the other "
#~ "worlds they hit. We managed to stop them here, in {sys}, and constructed "
#~ "this base. Since then it's been more or less a stalemate.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我想我们还没见过面。我是迪米特里少校。如果一切顺利，你将向我汇报下一项任"
#~ "务。\n"
#~ "\"你们听说过‘集体’吧？据我们所知，‘集体’似乎是一个机器人的‘蜂巢’。它们是最"
#~ "近的威胁；如果事发时或多或少有时间到达，否则它们会毫不费力地被皇帝的无敌舰"
#~ "队歼灭。它们彻底摧毁了埃罗克和他们袭击的其他世界的所有人类生命。我们设法在"
#~ "这里，在{sys}阻止了它们，并建造了这个基地。从那以后，或多或少陷入了僵局。"
#~ "\""

#~ msgid "Briefing"
#~ msgstr "简报"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Collective activity has increased heavily the last few decaperiods. "
#~ "We've been trying to contain them, but a scout broke through to the jump "
#~ "point. It was last detected by a patrol in {misn_nearby}, which saw it "
#~ "jumping out to {misn_target}. You are to locate the scout and report back "
#~ "to {pnt} in the {sys} system. It seems like the Collective is planning "
#~ "something and we want to follow their game a little closer.\n"
#~ "   \"It is of vital importance that you do not engage the drone. Report "
#~ "back as soon as you locate it.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"集体活动在过去几个时期大幅增加。我们一直在试图遏制他们，但有一名侦察兵突"
#~ "破了跳跃点。最后一次被{misn_nearby}的巡逻队发现，他们看到它跳到了"
#~ "{misn_target}。你的任务是找到这名侦察兵并向{sys}系统的{pnt}报告。看来集体"
#~ "正在计划一些事情，我们想更密切地跟踪他们的行动。\n"
#~ "    \"最重要的是你不能与无人机交战。一旦发现它，立即报告。\""

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "After landing, you head to the Empire military headquarters and find Lt. "
#~ "Commander Dimitri there.\n"
#~ "   \"Well it seems like the drone has some strange fixation on {sys}. We "
#~ "aren't quite sure what to make of it, but intelligence is working on it. "
#~ "Report back to the bar in a bit and we'll see what we can do about the "
#~ "Collective.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "着陆后，你前往帝国军事司令部，在那里找到了迪米特里少校。\n"
#~ "\"看起来这架无人机对{sys}有某种奇怪的迷恋。我们不太确定它是怎么回事，但情"
#~ "报部门正在调查它。稍后向酒吧报告，我们会看看我们能对Collective做些什么。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You scouted out a Collective drone on behalf of the Empire. Lt. Commander "
#~ "Dimitri told you to report back to the bar on Omega Enclave for your next "
#~ "mission."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你代表帝国侦察了一架集体无人机。迪米特里少校让你回Omega飞地酒吧报到，准备"
#~ "下一次任务。"

#~ msgid "Mission Failed: You weren't supposed to kill the drone!"
#~ msgstr "任务失败:你不应该杀死无人机！"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "You meet up with Lt. Commander Dimitri.\n"
#~ "   \"We managed to capture the drone after you located it. It didn't seem "
#~ "to be in good health. Our scientists are studying it as we speak, but "
#~ "we've found something strange in it. Some sort of weird wireless module. "
