#~ msgstr ""
#~ "海盗大会往往是一个很好的机会，海盗领主计算对方的实力，他们往往会从自己的舰"
#~ "队带来重要的船只。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In many ways, the pirate assemblies tend to not only determine the future "
#~ "of the space pirates, but also tend to shape the future of the galaxy."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在许多方面，海盗大会不仅决定了太空海盗的未来，而且还决定了银河系的未来。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The events tend to also attract the attention of other actors in the "
#~ "galaxy, with most Great Houses and [the Empire](lore/factions/empire) "
#~ "sending somewhat undercover agents to try to get a glimpse of what is "
#~ "going on and gain advantage over other Great Houses."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这些事件往往也会引起银河系其他势力的关注，大多数大家族和[帝国](lore/"
#~ "factions/empire)都会派遣一些卧底特工，试图窥探事态发展并取得对其他家族的优"
#~ "势。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "They also tend to run protection rackets, which are often favoured over "
#~ "the whimsical [Dvaered](lore/factions/dvaered) Warlords and can provide "
#~ "more stability to the area."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "他们还擅长经营保护费勒索，相比反复无常的[戴瓦德(Dvaered)](lore/factions/"
#~ "dvaered)军阀更受青睐，能为该区域带来更多稳定。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "They are also renowned for being a large hub of illicit substances, which "
#~ "their members use freely and some claim to get Sirius-like psychic powers "
#~ "from substance abuse."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "他们更以大规模违禁物质集散地闻名，成员可自由使用这些物质，有人声称滥用药物"
#~ "能获得天狼星般的心灵能力。"

#~ msgid "They are the Shaira, the Fyrra and the Serra."
#~ msgstr "他们是夏拉人、费拉人和塞拉人。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "At the head of each government stands an Arch-Canter, a zealot who can be "
#~ "considered the head of state for his particular echelon."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "每个政府的领导人都站着一位阿奇-坎特，一个狂热的人，可以被认为是其特定梯队"
#~ "的国家元首。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The three Arch Canters combined form the political government of House "
#~ "Sirius, and it is they who deal with any outside influence, including the "
#~ "Empire."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "三个拱门坎特人组成了天狼星家族的政治政府，他们负责处理任何外部影响，包括帝"
#~ "国。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Since that time there have been many Sirichanas, but all are assumed to "
#~ "be reincarnations of the original Sirichana, and so distinction is never "
#~ "made other than in a historical context."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "从那时起，有许多锡里卡纳，但所有都被认为是最初的锡里卡纳的转世，因此，只有"
#~ "在历史背景下才会做出区分。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "So great was their conviction that planet after planet began to slip from "
#~ "the Emperor's grasp, its inhabitants preferring to follow their faith "
#~ "than the Emperor's will."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "他们的信念如此坚定，以至于一个又一个星球开始从皇帝手中溜走，那里的居民更愿"
#~ "意遵循他们的信仰，而不是皇帝的意愿。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Emperor knew that he was no longer in control of the worlds following "
#~ "Sirichana, but to re-assert authority through force of arms on that scale "
#~ "would set a precedent unheard of since the end of the Faction Wars."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "皇帝知道，在西里查纳(Sirichana)之后，他不再控制世界，但通过如此规模的武力"
#~ "重新确立权威，将开创自派系战争结束以来闻所未闻的先例。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "And so he chose to grant Sirichana a Great House of his own, House "
#~ "Sirius, on the conditions that Sirichana would not attempt to spread his "
#~ "religion beyond the worlds that would be rightfully his, and that "
#~ "Imperial Decrees would carry the force of law among his people."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "因此，他选择授予西里查纳(Sirichana)一座属于他自己的大家族--天狼星家族，条"
#~ "件是西里查纳(Sirichana)不会试图将他的宗教传播到理应属于他的世界之外，并且"
#~ "帝国法令将在他的人民中携带法律的力量。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Sirichana agreed, knowing that refusal would give the Emperor the "
#~ "justification he needed to start an all out war."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "西里查纳(Sirichana)同意了，他知道拒绝会给皇帝带来发动全面战争所需的理由。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "After all, it is difficult to believe in a man who resides on a planet "
#~ "far from one's home. In point of fact, there is a good reason why people "
#~ "believe as strongly as they do."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "毕竟，居住在远离家乡的星球上的人是很难相信的。事实上，有一个很好的理由来解"
#~ "释为什么人们像他们一样坚信。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "All who live in Crater City leave whatever they're doing and stand in the "
#~ "streets to hear his words."
#~ msgstr "所有住在火山口城的人都放弃了他们正在做的事情，站在街上听他的话。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "But when he finishes speaking, his listeners are no longer the pilgrims "
#~ "they were before."
#~ msgstr "但当他说完后，他的听众不再是以前的朝圣者。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Touched then leave Crater City, abandoning it completely, leaving its "
#~ "houses, its tools, its resources behind for those pilgrims who will be "
#~ "coming."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "触神者」随后离开陨坑城，彻底弃置这座圣城，将城中屋舍、工具、资源悉数留存，"
#~ "供后续抵达的朝圣者取用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Before long, all [the Empire](lore/factions/empire) was getting out of "
#~ "its former Great Project was a yearly file of unintelligible reports, "
#~ "articles and theorems, many of which used forms of mathematics the "
#~ "Imperial engineers had never even heard of before."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "很快，[帝国](lore/factions/empire)从其宏伟计划中获得的只剩下一堆每年堆积的"
#~ "晦涩报告、论文和定理，其中许多使用的数学形式是帝国工程师们闻所未闻的。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When asked to provide [the Empire](lore/factions/empire) with tangible "
#~ "results such as pre-produced weapons or ships, the Za'lek indignantly "
#~ "replied that things like manufacturing things that had been successfully "
#~ "prototyped were beneath them."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当被要求向[帝国](lore/factions/empire)提供诸如预制武器或飞船等实际成果时，"
#~ "扎列克(Za'lek)家族愤然回应道，生产已经成功原型化的物品实在有失身份。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "At the same time, it became more isolated, its scientists choosing to "
#~ "devote their time to working on their myriad of projects rather than "
#~ "waste it on \"the simpletons elsewhere\"."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "与此同时，它变得更加与世隔绝，它的科学家选择把他们的时间投入到他们无数的项"
#~ "目上，而不是把时间浪费在\"其他地方的傻瓜\"上。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Though no new colonization efforts were made after the first twenty, as "
#~ "this was deemed too costly, different avenues of deep space exploration "
#~ "were being invented, tested and discarded on a regular basis."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "虽然在前二十年之后没有进行新的殖民努力，因为这被认为成本太高，但正在定期发"
#~ "明、测试和丢弃不同的深空探索途径。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Over the course of many years, many new planets were settled, converted "
#~ "or exploited."
#~ msgstr "在许多年的过程中，许多新的行星被定居、转换或开发。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Absorption reduces the amount of damage taken by a ship by a percentage "
#~ "amount."
#~ msgstr "吸收将舰船受到的损伤量减少一定百分比。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Note that penetration can not increase the damage past 100%, and "
#~ "absorption can only reduce the damage to 0%."
#~ msgstr "请注意，穿透并不能将伤害增加100%以上，吸收只能将伤害减少到0%。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Some types of effects can stack multiple types, which will be indicated "
#~ "by a number on the icon indicating how many stacks there are, while "
