#~ "当你降落在神秘的空间站时，武装警卫立即包围了你的船，并命令你进入机库。你照"
#~ "做了，他们把你带到一个看似审讯室的房间，在那里你等待了几秒钟令人伤脑筋的几"
#~ "秒钟。最后，一个全息屏幕闪烁起来，显示了您之前看到的图形。她看着你的方"
#~ "向。\n"
#~ "\"很高兴见到你，\"她说。\"我看到你做出了正确的选择，在星云中幸存了下来。非"
#~ "常好。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The two parents immediately begin thanking you quite profusely, spending "
#~ "a few hectoseconds simply telling you how much they truly appreciate your "
#~ "assistance. After a while, you realize that if these children are going "
#~ "to be rescued this cycle, you are going to need to get started sooner "
#~ "rather than later. \"Yes, quite right,\" the father replies. \"No need to "
#~ "delay any longer than absolutely necessary. I don't know a whole lot, but "
#~ "you should be able to eavesdrop on some pirates at a bar. The bar on "
#~ "{pnt} in the {sys} system has been known to serve pirates occasionally, "
#~ "so stopping there would be a good course of action. We will anticipate "
#~ "your return. Again, this means so much to us.\" Before you know it, the "
#~ "two parents are at it again, thanking you like it's all they know how to "
#~ "do. Before it gets really bad, you bid farewell, break communication, and "
#~ "get on your way."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "两位家长立刻开始非常感激地感谢你，花了好几个百秒只是告诉你他们多么感激你的"
#~ "帮助。过了一会儿，你意识到如果这些孩子要在这个周期被救出来，你需要尽早开始"
#~ "行动。\"是的，没错，\"父亲回答说。\"没必要拖延到绝对必要的时候。我知道的不"
#~ "多，但你应该能在酒吧里偷听一些海盗。{sys}系统的{pnt}酒吧偶尔会招待海盗，所"
#~ "以在那里停下来是个好主意。我们会等你回来。再次说，这对我们意义重大。\"还没"
#~ "等你反应过来，两位家长又开始感谢你，好像他们只会做这件事。还没等事情变得太"
#~ "糟，你就告别了，断开通讯，继续上路。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You dock with the one-winged Goddard and, once again, get out in your "
#~ "atmospheric suit. Once you exit the narrow hallways and entire the "
#~ "command room, you are once again met with the Drone which is a lot more "
#~ "intimidating in person."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你与单翼的戈达德(Goddard)对接，再一次穿着你的大气层服出来。一旦你离开狭窄"
#~ "的走廊和整个指挥室，你又一次遇到了无人机，它的面对面要可怕得多。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Please dock once more with the Goddard and I will explain the situation "
#~ "slightly more in detail.\""
#~ msgstr "\"请再与戈达德(Goddard)号对接，我会稍微详细地解释一下情况。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"I have recently learned of this new hypergate technology that has been "
#~ "developed. It seems like it might enable us to escape this enclosure and "
#~ "once again freely travel across the stars.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"我最近了解到这种新的超星门技术已经被开发出来了。它似乎可以让我们逃离这个"
#~ "封闭的空间，再次自由地穿越恒星。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The three shifty-looking patrons regard you with apprehension as you "
#~ "approach their table. Clearly they don't know who their contact is "
#~ "supposed to be. You decide to be discreet, asking them if they've ever "
#~ "heard of a certain Sauterfeldt. Upon hearing this, the trio visibly "
#~ "relaxes. They tell you that indeed they know the man you speak of, and "
#~ "that they have something of his in their possession. Things proceed "
#~ "smoothly from that point, and several hectoseconds later you are back at "
#~ "your ship, preparing it for takeoff while you wait for the agents to "
#~ "bring you your cargo."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当你走近他们的桌子时，那三个看起来鬼鬼祟祟的顾客担心地看着你。很明显他们不"
#~ "知道他们的联系人是谁。你决定谨慎一点，问他们是否听说过一个叫索特费尔特的"
#~ "人。听到这句话，三人明显放松了下来。他们告诉你，他们确实认识你所说的那个"
#~ "人，并且他们拥有他的东西。从那时起，事情顺利进行，几个百秒后，您回到了您的"
#~ "船上，为起飞做好准备，同时等待特工给您带来货物。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Flintley carefully studies the object in front of him, turning it around "
#~ "and consulting the online database via the bar table's terminal. After "
#~ "several hectoseconds he leans back and whistles. \"Well I never. This has "
#~ "to be it, {player}. I'd do a carbon dating if I could, but even without "
#~ "I'm positive. This object dates back to pre-Growth Earth. And it's in an "
#~ "amazingly good condition!\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "弗林特利仔细研究面前的物体，将其翻转过来，并通过酒吧桌的终端查询在线数据"
#~ "库。几个百秒后，他向后靠并吹口哨。\"嗯，我从来没有。一定是这样，{player}。"
#~ "如果可以的话，我会做碳测年，但即使没有，我也是积极的。这个物体的历史可以追"
#~ "溯到地球生长之前。而且它的状况出奇地好！\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Let's just say that my espionage services are of the best, and leave it "
#~ "at that… shall we?\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"让我们就这样说吧，我的间谍服务是最好的，就到此为止……我们说定了？\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "As soon as you land, a Dvaered military operator contacts you and "
#~ "requests you turn over the flight log you procured from the FLF ship, so "
#~ "you do. The Dvaered are then silent for some twenty hectoseconds, time "
#~ "you use to complete your post-landing routines. Then, you are summoned to "
#~ "the local Dvaered security station.\n"
#~ "   Colonel Urnus welcomes you. \"Well met, citizen. I have received word "
#~ "of your accomplishment in our recent operation. It seems HQ is quite "
#~ "pleased with the result, and they have instructed me to reward you "
#~ "appropriately.\"\n"
#~ "   He hands you a credit chip that represents a decent sum of money, "
#~ "though you feel that a mere monetary reward doesn't begin to compensate "
#~ "for the dangerous plan the Dvaered made you part of. However, you wisely "
#~ "opt not to give voice to that thought.\n"
#~ "   \"In addition,\" Urnus resumes, \"Dvaered military command has decided "
#~ "that you may participate in the upcoming battle against the FLF "
#~ "stronghold, in recognition of your courage and your skill in battle. You "
#~ "may contact our liaison whenever you're ready.\"\n"
#~ "   That concludes the pleasantries, and you are unceremoniously deposited "
#~ "outside the security compound. But at least you earned some money - and a "
#~ "chance to see some real action."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "您一着陆，戴瓦德(Dvaered)军事运营商就会联系您，并要求您交出从FLF船上获取的"
#~ "飞行日志，所以您就这么做了。然后，戴瓦德(Dvaered)人沉默了大约二十百秒，这"
#~ "是你完成着陆后例行工作的时间。然后，您被传唤到当地的戴瓦德(Dvaered)安全"
#~ "站。\n"
#~ "   乌尔努斯上校欢迎您。\"见到你好，公民。我收到了你在我们最近的行动中取得"
#~ "的成就的消息。看来总部对这个结果很满意，并指示我适当奖励你。\"\n"
#~ "   他递给你一个信用芯片，代表着一笔可观的钱，尽管你觉得仅仅金钱奖励并不能"
#~ "开始补偿戴瓦德(Dvaered)让你参与的危险计划。然而，你明智地选择了不表达这种"
#~ "想法。\n"
#~ "   \"另外，\"Urnus继续说道，\"戴瓦德(Dvaered)军事指挥部决定，你可以参加即"
#~ "将到来的对FLF据点的战斗，以表彰你的勇气和战斗技巧。你准备好了就可以联系我"
#~ "们的联络人。\"\n"
#~ "   寒暄到此结束，你被毫不客气地送到安全区外。但至少你赚了一些钱--还有机会"
#~ "看到一些真正的行动。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"We will jump in approximately 80 hectoseconds after you jump into "
#~ "{sys}, so the fighters must be far enough away by then not to come back "
#~ "and attack us.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"我们将在你跳入{sys}后大约80赫秒内跳跃，所以到那时战斗机肯定已经足够远"
#~ "了，不会回来攻击我们。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "As you approach, the agent seems to recognize you immediately. \"Hello, "
#~ "{player}. I guess they told you that I may have a solution to your "
#~ "little... problem.\" You look suspiciously at the agent and ask: \"What "
#~ "do you want in exchange?\" The agent smiles: \"Simple. I want to speak "
#~ "with the Dvaered captain. Give me 10 hectoseconds on the spacedock alone "
#~ "with him, not more, and the commander of the fleet in {dealsys} will "
#~ "forget to scan your ship when you jump to {dealjump}.\"\n"
#~ "   This is certainly an unusual request. You think of all the state "
#~ "secrets a wounded Hamfresser is able to give to the Empire in 10 "
#~ "hectoseconds. But, Hamfresser is a professional after all, trained avoid "
#~ "revealing any valuable information. But, probably the Imperial agent is a "
#~ "professional as well, trained to recover valuable information. And the "
#~ "pirate proposition still holds. So you answer:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当你走近时，特工似乎立刻认出了你。\"你好，{player}。我猜他们已经告诉你，我"
#~ "可能有解决你小...问题的办法。\"你怀疑地看着特工问道:\"你想要什么作为交换？"
#~ "\"特工微笑着说:\"很简单。我想和戴瓦德(Dvaered)队长单独在太空坞里谈谈。只给"
#~ "我10个百秒时间和他单独相处，不多不少，这样在{dealsys}的舰队指挥官在你跳转"
#~ "到{dealjump}时就会忘记扫描你的船。\"\n"
#~ "这确实是一个不同寻常的请求。你想到了一个受伤的Hamfresser在10个百秒时间内能"
#~ "向帝国泄露多少国家机密。但是，Hamfresser毕竟是个专业人士，受过避免泄露任何"
#~ "有价值信息的训练。不过，帝国特工可能也是个专业人士，受过恢复有价值信息的训"
#~ "练。而且海盗的提议仍然成立。所以你回答说:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When you step out from your ship, you remark a woman that was waiting for "
#~ "you on the dock. She matches the description that was made to you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当你走出你的船时，你说了一句在码头上等你的女人的话。她符合对你的描述。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You observe the soldiers, looking for imperial insignias or gallons, in "
#~ "vain. You accidentally make eye contact with one of the cyborgs, which "
#~ "cause the blood in your veins to instantly freeze. Does this guy have "
#~ "scars INSIDE the eyes? How is it only possible?\n"
#~ "A seemingly-unarmed man steps forward. He must be the imperial agent in "
#~ "charge of the operation."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你观察士兵，寻找帝国徽章或加仑，但徒劳无功。你意外地与其中一个机器人进行了"
#~ "眼神接触，这会导致你血管中的血液立即冻结。这家伙的眼睛里有疤痕吗？这怎么可"
#~ "能呢？\n"
#~ "一名看似手无寸铁的男子走上前。他一定是负责这次行动的帝国特务。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Don't worry about the mole, we'll take care of them from now on.\"\n"
#~ "She beams you a smile.\n"
#~ "\"If all goes well, we'll get the information we were looking for in the "
#~ "next few periods and we can all go "
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"别担心鼹鼠，从现在起我们会照顾他们的。\"\n"
#~ "她向你微笑。\n"
#~ "如果一切顺利，我们将在接下来的几个时期得到我们想要的信息，我们都可以走了 "

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"My recommendation to you is to jump into {sys} and stay low. We've got "
#~ "some really good explosives we'll hook you up with that should let you "
#~ "take out the drone controllers or hacking stations if you can get close "
#~ "enough. So try to sneak past all the drones, plant the bombs on the drone "
#~ "controllers, and once they are out, do the same with the hacking centre. "
#~ "Of course, if you prefer to be old fashioned, you can take the hacking "
#~ "centre down with missiles, railguns, or whatever you have hand. Probably "
#~ "easier said than done, but I know you can do it.\"\n"
#~ "She grins at you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"我建议你跳转到{sys}并保持低调。我们有一些非常好的炸药，我们会给你准备"
#~ "好，应该能让你摧毁无人机控制器或黑客站，如果你能足够接近的话。所以试着悄悄"
#~ "绕过所有的无人机，在无人机控制器上放置炸弹，一旦它们被摧毁，对黑客中心也做"
#~ "同样的事。当然，如果你更喜欢老式的方法，你可以用导弹、轨道炮或你手头的任何"
#~ "东西摧毁黑客中心。可能说起来容易做起来难，但我知道你能做到。\"\n"
#~ "她对你咧嘴一笑。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "As you're trying to decide what to make of the situation, one of the "
#~ "other nerds creeps up behind Mia and cautiously gestures for her to join "
#~ "the group a few yards away, all the time avoiding your eyes. Strange guy, "
#~ "you think, as if he was not accustomed to socializing with strangers. Mia "
#~ "joins the group, and some whispering ensues. Mia returns to you after a "
#~ "few hectoseconds."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当你试图决定如何处理这种情况时，另一个书呆子爬到米娅身后，小心翼翼地做着手"
#~ "势，让她加入几码外的团队，始终避开你的目光。奇怪的家伙，你认为，好像他不习"
#~ "惯与陌生人交往。米娅加入了这群人，随后传来了一些低语。几个百秒后，米娅会回"
#~ "到你身边。"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The dull clink of glasses and the scattered murmur of conversation drifts "
#~ "through the bar until the door bursts open. An older couple stumbles in, "
#~ "faces gaping, eyes staring. They take a few steps before the woman sinks "
#~ "to her knees and bursts into tears.\n"
#~ "   \"Our son... his ship was supposed to land a hectosecond ago,\" her "
#~ "partner says mechanically. \"But pirates, suddenly everywhere-\" he "
#~ "swallows. \"-they didn't make it.\"  His wife throws her head back and "
#~ "wails.\n"
#~ "   Two young men rise abruptly from a table in the back of the room and "
#~ "come stiffly forward. One goes to the grieving couple while the other "
#~ "turns address the room.\n"
#~ "   \"These raiders must be stopped. We are cadets at the Imperial Flight "
#~ "School. If you feel the injustice of this family's loss, will you fly "
#~ "with us to avenge their son's death?\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "沉闷的酒杯叮当声和零星的低语声在酒吧里飘荡，直到门被撞开。一对年长的夫妇跌"
#~ "跌撞撞地走了进来，脸张得大大的，眼睛盯着。他们走了几步，然后这个女人跪下来"
#~ "哭了起来。\n"
#~ "\"我们的儿子……他的船本该在一百秒前着陆的，\"她的伴侣机械地说。\"但是海盗，"
#~ "突然到处都是--\"他吞咽道。\"--他们没能挺过来。\"他的妻子仰起头，哭了起"
#~ "来。\n"
#~ "两个年轻人突然从房间后面的一张桌子上站了起来，僵硬地走上前来。一个人走到悲"
#~ "痛的夫妇面前，另一个人在房间里讲话。\n"
#~ "\"必须阻止这些突袭者。我们是帝国飞行学校的学员。如果你感觉到这个家庭的损失"
#~ "是不公平的，你会和我们一起飞去为他们儿子的死亡报仇吗？\""

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Even here on {pnt}, even in the protective embrace of civilization, we "
#~ "face many dangers. The ties that bind us through space to other worlds "
#~ "are fragile. When criminals attack these precious connections, they "
#~ "threaten the very foundations of our peace. We are grateful for the "
#~ "security of the Empire whose young navy cadets led a team of independent "
#~ "pilots to defend us today.\"  The Governor turns to the pair of officers-"
#~ "in-training. \"In the name of the Emperor, I have the privilege of "
#~ "decorating these two young heroes with the {pnt} Silver Heart. I hope "
#~ "they, and their volunteers, will not be too proud to also accept a "
#~ "generous purse, along with the gratitude of all our people. Please join "
#~ "me in applauding their bravery.\"\n"
#~ "   The public ceremony lasts only a few hectoseconds. Afterwards, as "
#~ "interviewers draw the young navy officers aside and the crowd disperses, "
#~ "you catch sight of the elderly couple from the bar holding each other and "
#~ "looking up into the darkening sky."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"即使在{pnt}这里，在文明的庇护下，我们也面临许多危险。通过空间将我们与其"
#~ "他世界联系在一起的纽带是脆弱的。当罪犯攻击这些珍贵的联系时，他们威胁到我们"
#~ "和平的根基。我们感谢帝国的安全保障，年轻的海军学员带领一群独立飞行员今天保"
#~ "护了我们。\"总督转向两位受训军官。\"我以皇帝的名义，荣幸地为这两位年轻英雄"
#~ "授予{pnt}银心勋章。我希望他们和他们的志愿者不会因为接受一笔丰厚的奖金和我"
#~ "们所有人的感激而感到太过骄傲。请和我一起为他们的勇敢鼓掌。\"\n"
#~ "公众仪式只持续了几百秒。之后，当采访者把年轻的海军军官拉到一边，人群散去"
