#~ msgid ""
#~ "Protera Husk seems to be the remains of a once populous city-world that "
#~ "took a turn for the worst in the aftermath of the Incident. The planet "
#~ "seems to have lost most of it's sphericity and has an extremely eccentric "
#~ "orbit. While this would usually be a major problem for any celestial "
#~ "body, it seems to be the least of the problems Protera Husk is facing, "
#~ "with radiation readings off the charts and endless destruction and "
#~ "carnage all over.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "The only place to land seems to be the urban remains of the elongated "
#~ "side of the planet. The rest of the planet is covered in a endless layer "
#~ "of ruins and decay. As your ship approaches, you pick up a surprising "
#~ "amount of lifeforms, it is best to be careful, you don't think you would "
#~ "be given a warm welcome by the natives. You keep a low profile on your "
#~ "entry to the feeble atmosphere, hoping to confuse your ship signature "
#~ "with the orbital rubbish.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "There is no functioning landing port, and you have to land among the "
#~ "rubble. At least it seems like you can refuel by siphoning from the "
#~ "remains of a fuel tank. You probably shouldn't overstay your welcome "
#~ "though."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Protera Husk 似乎是这个曾经人口稠密的城市世界的遗迹，在事件发生后，这个世"
#~ "界变得更加糟糕。这颗行星似乎已经失去了大部分的球形性，并且有一个极其偏心的"
#~ "轨道。虽然这通常是任何天体面临的一个主要问题，但这似乎是Protera Husk 面临"
#~ "的最小问题，辐射读数超出了图表，到处都是无穷无尽的破坏和屠杀。\n"
#~ "唯一可以着陆的地方似乎是地球细长一侧的城市遗迹。地球的其余部分被无穷无尽的"
#~ "废墟和腐烂所覆盖。当你的船靠近时，你捡到了数量惊人的生命体，最好小心，你不"
#~ "会认为你会受到当地人的热烈欢迎。你在进入微弱的大气层时保持低调，希望将你的"
#~ "飞船签名与轨道垃圾混淆。\n"
#~ "没有正常工作的登陆港，你必须在瓦砾中降落。至少看起来你可以通过从油箱的残留"
#~ "物中吸油来补充燃料。不过，你可能不应该在这里逗留太久。"

