#~ "UST 602:1983\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "It seems like we got another commission, but we have to go to some place "
#~ "called Hatter in Soromid space… The navigator claims he knows a shortcut, "
#~ "but I have a bad feeling about this.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "I want to run back home, but I can't quit so early. They would never stop "
#~ "making fun of me. Maybe Soromid space will be interesting?\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "We leave to Dune next period."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "UST 602:1983\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "看来我们又接到了新委托，但得去索洛米德(Soromid)星区一个叫哈特的地方...导航"
#~ "员声称他知道捷径，但我对此有不好的预感。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "我想逃回家，但不能这么早放弃。他们永远不会停止嘲笑我。也许索洛米德"
#~ "(Soromid)星区会很有趣？\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "下个周期我们出发去沙丘。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "UST (the date is blank)\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Something is scratching at the hull. It sounds like a weird animal. I "
#~ "haven't seen any living person in I don't know how long.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "There is no atmosphere and I can't take off my suit anymore. I don't see "
#~ "any way out."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "UST(日期为空)\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "有什么东西在划破船体。这听起来像是一只奇怪的动物。我不知道有多久没看到活着"
#~ "的人。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "没有气氛，我再也脱不下我的西装了。我看不到任何出路。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "UST (the date is blank)\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "I don't feel hunger anymore. The numbness sensation is spreading.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "The ships don't seem to pay me much attention as they come and go. They "
#~ "remind me of ants back home."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "UST(日期为空)\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "我再也不觉得饿了。麻木的感觉正在蔓延。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "船来了又走，似乎都不怎么注意我。它们让我想起了家乡的蚂蚁。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You approach the stressed out individual gnawing at their nails at the "
#~ "bar."
#~ msgstr "你走近酒吧里那个咬指甲的压力很大的人。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Say, you wouldn't be able to help me find my family? I'll pay, I "
#~ "promise!\""
#~ msgstr "\"你说，你不能帮我找到我的家人吗？我会付钱的我保证\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"My name is Lucas, I was a Nebula refugee. When I was very young, my "
#~ "family and I escaped the Incident, but I don't know what happened and I "
#~ "got separated.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"我叫卢卡斯，我是一名星云难民。当我很小的时候，我和家人逃离了这一事件，但"
#~ "我不知道发生了什么，我就失散了。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"I guess I never really thought about it too much, just did what I was "
#~ "told and went with the flow, but then one day I couldn't. You understand?"
#~ "\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"我想我从来没有真正考虑过这个问题，只是按照别人告诉我的去做，随波逐流，但"
#~ "有一天我做不到了。你明白吗？\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The pause and tighten their fists.\n"
#~ "\"I guess there was always something missing in me, like something "
#~ "fundamental was taken away by the Incident. However, I just didn't "
#~ "realize it, didn't understand.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "停顿一下，握紧拳头。\n"
#~ "\"我想我身上总是缺少一些东西，就像一些根本性的东西被事件夺走了。然而，我只"
#~ "是没有意识到，不明白。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"One day it snapped, and I had a dream remembering stuff I had forgotten "
#~ "about: my family. I guess I had repressed it for so long. Survival "
#~ "instincts maybe?\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"有一天，它突然折断了，我梦见了我忘记的东西:我的家人。我想我已经压抑了这"
#~ "么久了。也许是生存本能？\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Since then I've been trying to find my family with the credits I was "
#~ "able to scrounge up working. I don't think they had as much luck as I "
#~ "had, they are probably stuck on some refugee world. The governments don't "
#~ "care for us at all. They just toss refugees into barely habitable planets "
#~ "and turn their eyes away. We are humans too!\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"从那时起，我一直在努力寻找我的家人。我想他们没有我那么幸运，他们可能被困"
#~ "在了某个难民世界里。政府一点也不关心我们。他们只是把难民扔到几乎不适合居住"
#~ "的星球上，然后把视线移开。我们也是人！\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"I've narrowed it down a bit, I think they should be on {spb} in the "
#~ "{sys} system. Please try to find them! I'll give you all the information "
#~ "I have. Here take this locket, it is the only thing I have from them.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"我已经缩小了范围，我认为它们应该在{sys}系统中的{spb}上。请试着找到它们！"
#~ "我会把我掌握的所有信息都给你。给你这个吊坠，这是我从他们那里得到的唯一东"
#~ "西。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "They hand you an old locket that looks like is missing half of it. It is "
#~ "fairly simple and made of some resistant metal alloy, but bears signs of "
#~ "heavy use."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "他们递给你一个看起来少了一半的旧挂盒。它相当简单，由一些耐火的金属合金制"
#~ "成，但有大量使用的迹象。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You land and begin to ask around to see if there are any traces of Lucas "
#~ "family."
#~ msgstr "你降落后，开始四处打听是否有卢卡斯家族的踪迹。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "As you converse with many of the refugees at {spb}, you begin to "
#~ "appreciate the magnitude of the Incident calamity. Many refugees are "
#~ "missing or searching for family members, with deep psychological scars "
#~ "that are unable to heal."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当你在{spb}与许多难民交谈时，你开始意识到这一事件灾难的严重性。许多难民失"
#~ "踪或寻找家人，心理上留下了无法愈合的深深伤痕。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Feeling like searching for a needle in a haystack, you are almost about "
#~ "to give up when you find an older one-armed refugee. They take a close "
#~ "look at the locket and mention that they used to share a cell with "
#~ "someone using the same locket on {spb} in the {sys} system."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当你发现一个年长的独臂难民时，你就像大海捞针一样，几乎要放弃了。他们仔细查"
#~ "看了吊坠，并提到他们过去曾在{sys}系统中的{spb}上与使用同一吊坠的人共享一个"
#~ "细胞。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "From their story, it seems like {spb} is a horrible traumatic place, a "
#~ "refugee limbo where atrocities are commonplace. It also seems like the "
#~ "planet is locked down, you'll likely have to bribe the authorities to "
#~ "access it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "从他们的故事来看，{spb}似乎是一个可怕的创伤之地，一个难民的边缘，暴行司空"
#~ "见惯。这颗行星似乎也被封锁了，你很可能不得不贿赂当局才能进入它。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "They give you the location of the cell where they were and wish you luck. "
#~ "Looks like you have a lead."
#~ msgstr "他们会告诉你牢房所在的位置，并祝你好运。看起来你有线索了。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You manage to land on {spb}. Although things are quite quiet and clean "
#~ "around the spaceport, it all takes a turn for the worse once you pass the "
#~ "checkpoints and head into the slums towards the location you were given."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你设法降落在{spb}上。尽管航天港周围的一切都很安静和干净，但一旦你通过检查"
#~ "站，进入贫民窟，朝着你得到的位置前进，情况就会变得更糟。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The atmosphere is dark, almost oppressive, and you feel like you are "
#~ "given many stares by the locals. It seems likely that they do not get "
#~ "many visitors."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "气氛黑暗，几乎令人压抑，你感觉像是被当地人盯着看。他们似乎不太可能有很多访"
#~ "客。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You open the cell and find yourself with a very weakened old man. At "
#~ "first, they are scared to death, believing you have come to take their "
#~ "meagre possessions or their life, however, you are able to calm them down "
#~ "when you mention that Lucas sent you, and pass out."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你打开牢房，发现自己和一个非常虚弱的老人在一起。起初，他们害怕得要死，以为"
#~ "你是来夺走他们微薄的财产或生命的，然而，当你提到卢卡斯派你来的时候，他们就"
#~ "能平静下来，然后昏倒。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You quickly look around to see if there is anyone else there. Once you "
#~ "confirm that the man is the only person you pick them up and make your "
#~ "way back to the spaceport. Likely due to malnourishment, the old man is a "
#~ "much lighter load than you had expected. On the way back, surprisingly "
#~ "enough, people seem to take less notice of you than when you came in."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你迅速环顾四周，看看是否还有其他人在那里。一旦你确认这个人是唯一的人，你就"
#~ "把他们接起来，然后返回航天港。很可能是因为营养不良，这位老人的负担比你想象"
#~ "的要轻得多。在回来的路上，令人惊讶的是，人们似乎没有你进来时那么注意你。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The old man is in not very good shape and seems to fall into a deep "
#~ "slumber when you set them aboard the ship, would be best to try to head "
#~ "back to Lucas as soon as possible."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "老人的状态不是很好，当你把他们送上船时，他似乎陷入了沉睡，最好尽快返回卢卡"
#~ "斯。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When Lucas sees the old man, his eyes tear up, and he kneels to take a "
#~ "closer look.\n"
#~ "\"Dear old man, what have they done to you?\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当卢卡斯看到老人时，他的眼睛泪流满面，跪下来仔细看了看。\n"
#~ "\"亲爱的老头，他们对你做了什么？\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Still kneeling, Lucas shuffles forward and emotively hugs the old man. "
#~ "Probably not the reunion they were looking for, but better than nothing "
#~ "nonetheless."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "卢卡斯仍然跪着，拖着脚步向前走，动情地拥抱着老人。可能不是他们想要的重聚，"
#~ "但总比什么都没有强。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "After a solemn while, Lucas kisses the old man on the cheek and turns to "
#~ "you.\n"
#~ "\"Thank you for what you've done. I think I can take care of it from now "
#~ "on. I have to see what happened to the others.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "过了一会儿，卢卡斯在老人的脸颊上吻了一下，然后转向你。\n"
#~ "\"谢谢你们所做的一切。我想从现在开始我能处理好这件事。我要看看其他人怎么样"
#~ "了。\""

#~ msgid "You approach Lucas who seems to be more on the edge than before."
#~ msgstr "你走近卢卡斯，他似乎比以前更紧张了。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Aw, screw it. I messed up. I put my faith in the system and got rammed "
#~ "over. They teach us like trash, useless garbage.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "哦，去他的。我搞砸了。我把我的信心放在体制上，结果被撞倒了。他们教我们就像"
#~ "教垃圾一样，没用的垃圾。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"I thought we were at fault, as if we had done something wrong and had "
#~ "to be punished. However, it was not we who did the wronging.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"我认为我们有过错，好像我们做错了什么，必须受到惩罚。然而，错的不是我们。"
#~ "\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"My sister and mother succumbed at Maanen's Moon, and my father, my poor "
#~ "father, was refused any damn treatments in this so-called civilized "
#~ "society.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我的姐姐和母亲在马嫩的月亮上屈服了，我的父亲，我可怜的父亲，在这个所谓的文"
#~ "明社会里被拒绝了任何该死的待遇。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"The bureaucrats refuse treating illegal nebula refugees. They even "
#~ "wanted to take him back to Maanen's bloody Moon! Heartless bastards.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"官僚们拒绝治疗非法的星云难民。他们甚至想把他带回马南的血腥月球！冷酷无情"
#~ "的混蛋。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"When he passed away in my arms, I lost all hope. I thought I had no "
#~ "option but to repent and follow my family. But then I realize, why are we "
#~ "at fault? Is it not the role of civilization to look for the betterment "
#~ "of mankind?\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当他在我怀里去世时，我失去了所有的希望。我以为我别无选择，只能忏悔和追随我"
#~ "的家人。但后来我意识到，为什么是我们的错？寻找人类的更好不是文明的作用吗？"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"I decided to turn to anger, and want to take my revenge and carve my "
#~ "own path.\""
#~ msgstr "我决定转向愤怒，想要复仇，开辟自己的道路。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Wait, you are not surprised?\"\n"
#~ "They lean in and whisper to you.\n"
#~ "\"Don't tell me you are a… Wait no, it's probably better to not know now."
#~ "\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"等等，你不感到惊讶吗？\"\n"
#~ "他们靠过来和你窃窃私语。\n"
#~ "\"别告诉我你是…等等，现在还不知道可能更好。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Pirates are thought to be brutes unfit for society, however, that is "
#~ "just the lower rungs. The pirate clans are actually fully functional "
#~ "societies, and less arbitrary and oppressive than the Empire and the "
#~ "Houses.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"海盗被认为是与社会格格不入的畜生，但这只是底层社会。海盗家族实际上是功能"
#~ "齐全的社会，没有帝国和豪宅那么专断和压迫。\""

#~ msgid "They go back to their state of nervous anxiety and hope."
#~ msgstr "他们回到了紧张、焦虑和希望的状态。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"I've been told some pirates like to hang around {spob} in the {sys} "
#~ "system. We should head over there to see if we can find some lead.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "'有人告诉我，一些海盗喜欢在{sys}系统的{spob}附近徘徊。我们应该去那里看看能"
#~ "不能找到一些线索。'"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You approach the shady character, who doesn't seem very keen on your "
#~ "attention, and begin to make some idle conversation in hopes of drawing "
#~ "out information about {spob}."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你接近那个看起来不太喜欢你关注的可疑人物，并开始闲聊，希望能引出一些关于"
#~ "{spob}的信息。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The character is less than cooperative, and seems more interested in "
#~ "getting rid of you than providing any help. It seems to be an exercise in "
#~ "futility."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这个角色不太合作，似乎更感兴趣的是摆脱你，而不是提供任何帮助。这似乎是一次"
#~ "徒劳的练习。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Eventually they start ignoring you and go away. Given the amount of "
#~ "people and security on the station, there is not really anything you can "
#~ "do."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "最终，他们开始忽视你，然后走开。考虑到空间站上的人数和安全，你真的无能为"
#~ "力。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You look around, but it doesn't look like the people here are going to be "
#~ "the most helpful bunch, you'll have to find another way to get the "
#~ "information."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你环顾四周，但看起来这里的人不会是最有帮助的一群人，你必须找到另一种方式来"
#~ "获得信息。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You meet up with Lucas, who was also trying to get the information "
#~ "independently, albeit to the same result."
#~ msgstr "你遇到了卢卡斯，他也试图独立获得信息，尽管结果是一样的。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "He lets out a large sigh.\n"
#~ "\"It doesn't look like we're getting anywhere.\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "他长叹了一口气。\n"
#~ "\"看起来我们不会有任何进展。\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You board the ship with Lucas and through methods you are not "
#~ "particularly proud of, are able to obtain information of a secret jump "
#~ "likely leading to the Qorel tunnel. You are told that {spob} is somewhere "
#~ "there."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你和卢卡斯一起登上了船，通过一些你并不特别自豪的方法，得到了一个可能通往库"
#~ "雷尔隧道的秘密跳跃点的信息。你被告知{spob}就在那里的某个地方。"

