#~ "Where \"C\" is the cycle, \"PPPP\" is the period (always displayed as "
#~ "four digits), and \"SSSS\" is the second (always displayed as four "
#~ "digits). So for example, the following hypothetical date indicates cycle "
#~ "493, period 42, second 2089 (which is about 100 cycles prior to [the "
#~ "Incident](lore/history/incident):"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "其中\"C\"是周期，\"PPPP\"是周期(始终显示为四位数)，而\"SSSS\"是第二个周期"
#~ "(始终显示为四位数)。因此，例如，以下假设日期表示第493周期，第42周期，2089"
#~ "年第二个周期(这大约是[事件](lore/history/incident)之前的100个周期):"

#~ msgid "* 783p (read as \"783 periods\")"
