#~ "好的，{player}。一旦你准备好了，就在吧台等我。我们将制定一个抓天鹅的计划。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Hi, {name}. Did you have fun out there with the Imperial pilots?\n"
#~ "Meanwhile, our boy Ak-Ak did make his investigation. He got his cyborgs "
#~ "to break a few knees, and now we know what happened to the lost pilot."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你好，{name}。你和帝国飞行员在那里玩得开心吗？\n"
