#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这次任务未能按计划进行，对你来说其实是件好事:现在你已向戴瓦德(Dvaered)最高"
#~ "指挥部证明了自己是可靠的飞行员。我不知道你是否打算继续为他们效力，但我掌握"
#~ "的情报显示，他们未来可能会给你更多任务。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "I don't know how much you did understand of our conversation on the "
#~ "spaceport, but we need you now to disable the ship of a pilot surnamed "
#~ "'Shaky Swan'. He is supposed to be hanging around {sys} in the near "
#~ "future."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我不知道你对我们在太空港的谈话有多了解，但我们现在需要你让一位姓‘摇摇天鹅’"
#~ "的飞行员的飞船失灵。他应该在不久的将来会在{sys}附近闲逛。"

#~ msgid "Ask for details on the operation"
#~ msgstr "询问有关行动的细节"

#~ msgid "Tell her you need more information on the context"
#~ msgstr "告诉她你需要更多关于背景的信息"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Protest and tell her you initially were only supposed to deliver a parcel"
#~ msgstr "抗议并告诉她你最初只应该递送一个包裹"

#~ msgid "Tell her you know what to do"
#~ msgstr "告诉她你知道该怎么做"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "According to our information, Shaky Swan is in the Frontier sector right "
#~ "now, flying a Tristan, presumably under FLF transponder. He might soon "
#~ "enter {sys1} from the jump point to {sys2}.\n"
#~ "Your task will be to approach, engage and disable his ship. Only "
