#~ msgstr "我才不在乎呢"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You obviously have no idea what you are talking about.\n"
#~ "Shall you see the death squadrons taking off from Halir, loaded with all "
#~ "the kinds of deadly viruses only human madness can breed. Shall you see "
#~ "the fleet of the united Warlords silently flying towards humanity's doom "
#~ "before a helpless sky of horrified stars. Shall you see them hide the sun "
#~ "of Doranthex as would the black wings of death.\n"
#~ "Shall you hear the frenetic lament of sirens while the sky of Antica gets "
#~ "torn apart by the trails of hypersonic bombs. Shall you hear the roaring "
#~ "of space stations, wounded to death by torpedoes, disseminating into the "
#~ "void the helpless bodies of their inhabitants."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你显然不知道你在说什么。\n"
#~ "你会看到死亡中队从哈里尔起飞，装载着只有人类疯狂才能滋生的各种致命病毒吗？"
#~ "你会看到联合军阀的舰队在无助的惊恐星空中默默地向人类的末日飞去吗？你是否会"
#~ "看到他们隐藏着多兰西克斯(Doranthex)的太阳，就像他们隐藏着死亡的黑色翅"
#~ "膀。\n"
#~ "当安提卡的天空被高超音速炸弹的痕迹撕裂时，你会听到疯狂的警报声吗？你是否会"
#~ "听到被鱼雷炸死的空间站的咆哮声，将其居民无助的身体散布到虚空中。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Maybe you think that as a pilot, you won't endure starvation, contrary to "
#~ "the billions of poor souls who will struggle to survive the nuclear "
#~ "winter on their sterilized planets. Maybe you think you won't have to "
#~ "endure the gaze of the slowly dying victims of incendiary bombs, bio-"
#~ "weapons, climatic and seismic bombs..."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "也许你认为，作为一名飞行员，你不会忍受饥饿，而不是数十亿可怜的灵魂，他们将"
#~ "在他们灭菌的星球上挣扎着度过核冬天。也许你认为你不必忍受燃烧炸弹、生物武"
#~ "器、气候和地震炸弹慢慢死去的受害者的凝视……"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "But this won't be the worst! Because I've got my information. And the "
#~ "Empire has weapons even more powerful. Even more abominable. Even more "
#~ "unmentionable and unimaginable. Some say the Incident was provoked by a "
#~ "such weapon. Imagine if they decide to make a new incident happen!\n"
#~ "Then you would have to bare that monstrous responsibility on your "
#~ "shoulders. Just because you refused to catch that shaky bastard!"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "但这还不是最糟糕的！因为我已经得到了我的信息。帝国拥有更强大的武器。更令人"
#~ "讨厌的是。更令人费解和难以想象的是。一些人说，这起事件是由这样的武器挑起"
#~ "的。想象一下，如果他们决定制造一起新的事件！\n"
#~ "那么你将不得不把这一巨大的责任压在你的肩上。就因为你拒绝抓住那个摇摇欲坠的"
#~ "混蛋！"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Because war is not that far away, you know. Galactopolitics has not been "
#~ "that unstable since the end of the Faction's war. Our work is to do our "
#~ "best to have the Empire and House Dvaered barely tolerate each other. If "
#~ "there were not, they would soon start a war, and House Sirius, Za'lek and "
#~ "Soromids would follow.\n"
#~ "   I know you were only asked to transport a random parcel, but this "
#~ "pilot who disappears is serious business. We have to find who is behind "
#~ "that disappearance. And by the way, you can be ensured that you will be "
#~ "paid more than whatever initial reward was promised to you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "因为战争离我们并不遥远，你知道吗。自从派系战争结束以来，银河政治从未如此动"
#~ "荡。我们的工作就是尽力让帝国和戴瓦德(Dvaered)家族勉强维持互相容忍的关系。"
#~ "如果没有我们，他们很快就会开战，天狼星家族、扎列克(Za'lek)和索洛米德"
#~ "(Soromid)也会紧随其后。\n"
#~ "   我知道你只是被要求运输一个普通包裹，但那个失踪的飞行员事关重大。我们必"
#~ "须找出幕后黑手。顺便说一句，你可以放心，你的报酬将远超最初承诺的奖励。"

